(539281, 54688, 6388, '<td valign="top">Once I''m done voting, i go back and comment on the images from the top down.  this is my first comment.  ''Nuff said. (my only nine in the last 3 challenges I''ve voted on)</td>', 'Once I''m done voting, i go back and comment on the images from the top down.  this is my first comment.  ''Nuff said. (my only nine in the last 3 challenges I''ve voted on)', '2004-01-12 02:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(539282, 54599, 6388, '<td valign="top">I\''ll be choked if this doesn\''t score well.  It\''s the best I\''ve seen after voting on more than half the images.  the digital noise blends nicely with the stars :)  The blue toning is a nice touch - not sure if it was PS or naturaly, but i like it.<br/>P</td>', 'I\''ll be choked if this doesn\''t score well.  It\''s the best I\''ve seen after voting on more than half the images.  the digital noise blends nicely with the stars :)  The blue toning is a nice touch - not sure if it was PS or naturaly, but i like it.P', '2004-01-12 02:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(539283, 54668, 6388, '<td valign="top">I can''t condone the smoking, but i like the image :)  The ember is awesome against the blue smoke.  very nicely done.</td>', 'I can''t condone the smoking, but i like the image :)  The ember is awesome against the blue smoke.  very nicely done.', '2004-01-12 02:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
