(539362, 54711, 12733, '<td valign="top">Is the resemblance to a mushroom cloud intentional, or did it just work out that way? Very nice colors and capture on the setting sun. I really like the rim lighting on the bottom of the cloud.</td>', 'Is the resemblance to a mushroom cloud intentional, or did it just work out that way? Very nice colors and capture on the setting sun. I really like the rim lighting on the bottom of the cloud.', '2004-01-12 06:06:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(539363, 54336, 7263, '<td valign="top">ace, a ten for sure. Good luck. Shows that you don''t have to live in a huge city to get a great night shot - the best thus far.</td>', 'ace, a ten for sure. Good luck. Shows that you don''t have to live in a huge city to get a great night shot - the best thus far.', '2004-01-12 06:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(539365, 54542, 7263, '<td valign="top">great leading line, and even better sky shades, you took this at exactly the right time. If you could edit I would remove the plane and the building on the right as it''s over xped. but good luck 9.</td>', 'great leading line, and even better sky shades, you took this at exactly the right time. If you could edit I would remove the plane and the building on the right as it''s over xped. but good luck 9.', '2004-01-12 06:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
