(539401, 54711, 6999, '<td valign="top">Basically a great idea for a shot, badly let down by the technical work: love the sun through the steam from the cooling towers, but the processing artefacts, the tilt of the image, the strange framing (why so much at the bottom, and why cut off the top of the steam clouds?) lose you points from me.</td>', 'Basically a great idea for a shot, badly let down by the technical work: love the sun through the steam from the cooling towers, but the processing artefacts, the tilt of the image, the strange framing (why so much at the bottom, and why cut off the top of the steam clouds?) lose you points from me.', '2004-01-12 07:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
