(539426, 54775, 14614, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite of the moon shots.  Creative idea and interesting effect -- looks like it was taken inside - another good idea on a cold night :)  The bottom''s lack of ice pulls my eye away from the subject a bit and may be better cropped?</td>', 'This is my favorite of the moon shots.  Creative idea and interesting effect -- looks like it was taken inside - another good idea on a cold night :)  The bottom''s lack of ice pulls my eye away from the subject a bit and may be better cropped?', '2004-01-12 08:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
