(539431, 54374, 14614, '<td valign="top">Great idea here - lots going on with the tree that doesn''t pull my eye toward the subject.  I''d like to see the moon a bit crisper and less "hot"</td>', 'Great idea here - lots going on with the tree that doesn''t pull my eye toward the subject.  I''d like to see the moon a bit crisper and less "hot"', '2004-01-12 08:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(539437, 54178, 14614, '<td valign="top">Nicely done "tree" shot.  The color adds interest as does the far away sky. Your creative angle make this all it can be.  Nice job</td>', 'Nicely done "tree" shot.  The color adds interest as does the far away sky. Your creative angle make this all it can be.  Nice job', '2004-01-12 08:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(539443, 54758, 14614, '<td valign="top">They''ve landed!  The blurry fore and back ground are a bit distracting so I''m not sure if it''s a UFO or an airplane.</td>', 'They''ve landed!  The blurry fore and back ground are a bit distracting so I''m not sure if it''s a UFO or an airplane.', '2004-01-12 08:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(539445, 54768, 14614, '<td valign="top">The green tree against the black night is dramatic. The streetligh detracts from the picture as it draws my eye away from the tree and stars.</td>', 'The green tree against the black night is dramatic. The streetligh detracts from the picture as it draws my eye away from the tree and stars.', '2004-01-12 08:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(539446, 54736, 14614, '<td valign="top">Nice detail on the bark .  The cut off branches detract from your overall effect (the truck fading into black is better).</td>', 'Nice detail on the bark .  The cut off branches detract from your overall effect (the truck fading into black is better).', '2004-01-12 08:39:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(539447, 54776, 14614, '<td valign="top">Nice "tree" shots.  Your shot is moody with interesting lighting and the stars add interest</td>', 'Nice "tree" shots.  Your shot is moody with interesting lighting and the stars add interest', '2004-01-12 08:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(539462, 54725, 10785, '<td valign="top">This picture is really cool. The lighting is interesting but the foreground objects distract greatly. (Telephone and table) You should have moved them out of there.</td>', 'This picture is really cool. The lighting is interesting but the foreground objects distract greatly. (Telephone and table) You should have moved them out of there.', '2004-01-12 09:10:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(539468, 54766, 6870, '<td valign="top">Really lovely light. I like her expression and pose; it seems quite natural and thoughtful. Nice work! 9</td>', 'Really lovely light. I like her expression and pose; it seems quite natural and thoughtful. Nice work! 9', '2004-01-12 09:14:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(539470, 54770, 6870, '<td valign="top">Strong composition with the barge in upper right. I like the negative space in front. It may be just a bit too dark, but since I can still see the ship''s details--or many of them--I still find it to be effective.</td>', 'Strong composition with the barge in upper right. I like the negative space in front. It may be just a bit too dark, but since I can still see the ship''s details--or many of them--I still find it to be effective.', '2004-01-12 09:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(539473, 53919, 6870, '<td valign="top">The willy-nilly posiiton of the petals really captures interesting light here. Too bad the Dec. rules are gone. YOu could have cloned out that leave at bottom right. Lovely use of directional light and color.</td>', 'The willy-nilly posiiton of the petals really captures interesting light here. Too bad the Dec. rules are gone. YOu could have cloned out that leave at bottom right. Lovely use of directional light and color.', '2004-01-12 09:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(539474, 54615, 8139, '<td valign="top">Great stylish.</td>', 'Great stylish.', '2004-01-12 09:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(539476, 54703, 6870, '<td valign="top">What I like most about this shot is your tonal range. The darks are nice and rich and the lights are nice and light. My attention ultimately goes to the van down right because of the street and lines and light. I would think you''d want my attention to start there, and them move up? Nice work. 8</td>', 'What I like most about this shot is your tonal range. The darks are nice and rich and the lights are nice and light. My attention ultimately goes to the van down right because of the street and lines and light. I would think you''d want my attention to start there, and them move up? Nice work. 8', '2004-01-12 09:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(539478, 54523, 6870, '<td valign="top">INteresting details. The refracted light is so interesting, and the details provide interesting clues as to what this shot is all about. It is difficult, however, to add up all of the clues with the evidence given, so it is not quite an abstract and not quite a shot about anything in particular. It''s somewhere in the middle.</td>', 'INteresting details. The refracted light is so interesting, and the details provide interesting clues as to what this shot is all about. It is difficult, however, to add up all of the clues with the evidence given, so it is not quite an abstract and not quite a shot about anything in particular. It''s somewhere in the middle.', '2004-01-12 09:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(539480, 54561, 6870, '<td valign="top">That little curve makes this shot nice and dynamic. My gaze ultimately ends up left on those lighted concret pads (?), and I''m not sure that is where you want me looking.</td>', 'That little curve makes this shot nice and dynamic. My gaze ultimately ends up left on those lighted concret pads (?), and I''m not sure that is where you want me looking.', '2004-01-12 09:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(539481, 54766, 8139, '<td valign="top">Beautiful glamorous portrait.<br/>Well composed and lighted.<br/>Not sure it meets totally the challenge, but this is a quality photo.</td>', 'Beautiful glamorous portrait.Well composed and lighted.Not sure it meets totally the challenge, but this is a quality photo.', '2004-01-12 09:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(539483, 54576, 8139, '<td valign="top">Use a tripod anf focus manually if possible.<br/>The moon is difficult to capture.</td>', 'Use a tripod anf focus manually if possible.The moon is difficult to capture.', '2004-01-12 09:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(539486, 54760, 14614, '<td valign="top">Dome in great focus - front lower level looks soft.</td>', 'Dome in great focus - front lower level looks soft.', '2004-01-12 09:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(539488, 54690, 14614, '<td valign="top">Don''t know why this shot is smaller than the others - hard to see.  Looks in focus.</td>', 'Don''t know why this shot is smaller than the others - hard to see.  Looks in focus.', '2004-01-12 09:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(539492, 54657, 14614, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  I like that the people in the window are clear.  The light in the shop window on the right detracts from your lovely scene.</td>', 'Nicely done.  I like that the people in the window are clear.  The light in the shop window on the right detracts from your lovely scene.', '2004-01-12 09:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(539493, 54642, 14614, '<td valign="top">Your title fights a bit with the shot as the castle is hard to see and is overpowered by the lights.</td>', 'Your title fights a bit with the shot as the castle is hard to see and is overpowered by the lights.', '2004-01-12 09:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(539494, 54261, 14614, '<td valign="top">The angle adds some interest - the water on the windshield blurs the detail and makes the background more pleasing.  Not sure if the dashboard has enough interest to be the subject.</td>', 'The angle adds some interest - the water on the windshield blurs the detail and makes the background more pleasing.  Not sure if the dashboard has enough interest to be the subject.', '2004-01-12 09:36:19.000000', NULL, 1),
