(539497, 54594, 14614, '<td valign="top">Powerful shot - like the ghostly cross through the daughter.  Tighter cropping would eliminate all but the emotional message of this photo</td>', 'Powerful shot - like the ghostly cross through the daughter.  Tighter cropping would eliminate all but the emotional message of this photo', '2004-01-12 09:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(539498, 54464, 14614, '<td valign="top">Clever title, background water could be less bright.</td>', 'Clever title, background water could be less bright.', '2004-01-12 09:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(539504, 54672, 12802, '<td valign="top">Very nice long exposure here.  The wee stones? at the front look like sad faces...<br/> <br/>The details here are brilliant.  The whole surface looks like some kind of space age metal, when I suspect it''s just the water.  The little stones all round look like littel faces all looking something.  <br/> <br/>The larger stone at the top of brilliant, can I see some dirty marks though in the top of the water?  <br/> <br/>A great shot, no hesitation in giving this a 10!</td>', 'Very nice long exposure here.  The wee stones? at the front look like sad faces... The details here are brilliant.  The whole surface looks like some kind of space age metal, when I suspect it''s just the water.  The little stones all round look like littel faces all looking something.   The larger stone at the top of brilliant, can I see some dirty marks though in the top of the water?   A great shot, no hesitation in giving this a 10!', '2004-01-12 09:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(539505, 54764, 13136, '<td valign="top">Nice silhouette on the birds. They seem a bit fuzzy maybe. Not sure this is "after Dark" when you can still see the sunset. Good color on the sky.</td>', 'Nice silhouette on the birds. They seem a bit fuzzy maybe. Not sure this is "after Dark" when you can still see the sunset. Good color on the sky.', '2004-01-12 09:53:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(539507, 54728, 6359, '<td valign="top">After dark?</td>', 'After dark?', '2004-01-12 09:55:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(539508, 54759, 6359, '<td valign="top">After dark?</td>', 'After dark?', '2004-01-12 09:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
