(539510, 54594, 12802, '<td valign="top">A good shot here, like the idea of the girl in the background, well timed exposure here.  Only thing would have been that I might have liked it a bit sharper.  Think you were trying to show this as a soft focus, personally don''t think it works though.  8</td>', 'A good shot here, like the idea of the girl in the background, well timed exposure here.  Only thing would have been that I might have liked it a bit sharper.  Think you were trying to show this as a soft focus, personally don''t think it works though.  8', '2004-01-12 09:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
