(539545, 54773, 13136, '<td valign="top">I see sunlight and no indication of lights on the buildings themselves. Maybe you should have waited a half hour to take this shot.</td>', 'I see sunlight and no indication of lights on the buildings themselves. Maybe you should have waited a half hour to take this shot.', '2004-01-12 10:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
