(539563, 54717, 6870, '<td valign="top">NIce use of a long exposure. I imagine  your f stop was pretty tight for this shot! I like the effect.</td>', 'NIce use of a long exposure. I imagine  your f stop was pretty tight for this shot! I like the effect.', '2004-01-12 10:23:11.000000', NULL, 1),
