(539568, 54719, 6870, '<td valign="top">Fascinating spider study. She looks almost transparent here. B/W works well to bring attn to the details and the form. Composition is strong.</td>', 'Fascinating spider study. She looks almost transparent here. B/W works well to bring attn to the details and the form. Composition is strong.', '2004-01-12 10:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(539569, 54766, 6359, '<td valign="top">Great photo but is she better photographed after dark?</td>', 'Great photo but is she better photographed after dark?', '2004-01-12 10:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(539570, 54261, 6870, '<td valign="top">The tilt works to add interest, though I''m not sure it is useful beyond that. I love the colors and composition. THe rain on the windshield is particularly interesting--and this is where my attention ultimately ends up.</td>', 'The tilt works to add interest, though I''m not sure it is useful beyond that. I love the colors and composition. THe rain on the windshield is particularly interesting--and this is where my attention ultimately ends up.', '2004-01-12 10:25:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(539572, 54354, 6870, '<td valign="top">I like the colorful cast to this image, and your use of motion blur is effective.</td>', 'I like the colorful cast to this image, and your use of motion blur is effective.', '2004-01-12 10:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(539573, 54662, 13136, '<td valign="top">Cool shot. Well done.</td>', 'Cool shot. Well done.', '2004-01-12 10:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(539574, 54594, 6359, '<td valign="top">How do you get a clear ghost with no signs of movement going or coming from crying person?</td>', 'How do you get a clear ghost with no signs of movement going or coming from crying person?', '2004-01-12 10:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(539575, 54711, 6359, '<td valign="top">After dark?</td>', 'After dark?', '2004-01-12 10:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(539577, 54671, 5158, '<td valign="top">Awesome picture! <br/>I like the light in her face very much and the expression: very concentrated. Also the complete darknes surrounding her adds a lot to the mood of this picture. One of my favorits. Good luck!</td>', 'Awesome picture! I like the light in her face very much and the expression: very concentrated. Also the complete darknes surrounding her adds a lot to the mood of this picture. One of my favorits. Good luck!', '2004-01-12 10:27:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(539578, 54488, 13136, '<td valign="top">I might have zoomed in and darkened it a bit to bring out the creepyness. Good subject.</td>', 'I might have zoomed in and darkened it a bit to bring out the creepyness. Good subject.', '2004-01-12 10:27:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(539579, 54624, 6870, '<td valign="top">Lovely sillhouette against that marvelous sky. Just a bit more contrast may saturate your colors more and give it even more ''umph.'' You may be criticized by some that this is not yet ''nocturnal'', but I like it. 7</td>', 'Lovely sillhouette against that marvelous sky. Just a bit more contrast may saturate your colors more and give it even more ''umph.'' You may be criticized by some that this is not yet ''nocturnal'', but I like it. 7', '2004-01-12 10:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(539581, 54621, 6870, '<td valign="top">Go Gino! INteresting use of flash and a longer exposure. I like his facial expression!</td>', 'Go Gino! INteresting use of flash and a longer exposure. I like his facial expression!', '2004-01-12 10:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(539582, 54576, 6359, '<td valign="top">You need a tripod for long distant shots. The further the subject the more movement will affect your photo.</td>', 'You need a tripod for long distant shots. The further the subject the more movement will affect your photo.', '2004-01-12 10:29:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(539583, 54657, 13136, '<td valign="top">I really like how the waiter is looking forlornly out the window. Too bad you did not have any patrons at an outside table. Nice shot.</td>', 'I really like how the waiter is looking forlornly out the window. Too bad you did not have any patrons at an outside table. Nice shot.', '2004-01-12 10:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(539584, 54662, 6870, '<td valign="top">I suppose that this could be menacing to some. I find it engaging and lovely! Very nice composition and super use of a long exposure to get the right light. 10</td>', 'I suppose that this could be menacing to some. I find it engaging and lovely! Very nice composition and super use of a long exposure to get the right light. 10', '2004-01-12 10:29:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(539585, 54776, 13136, '<td valign="top">Good lighting on the trees while still getting the stars.</td>', 'Good lighting on the trees while still getting the stars.', '2004-01-12 10:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(539586, 54033, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very atmospheric image. I find your use of tone here very pleasant. I do wish the town itself were sharper, but this  photo is very moody, and I really enjoy it. 8</td>', 'Very atmospheric image. I find your use of tone here very pleasant. I do wish the town itself were sharper, but this  photo is very moody, and I really enjoy it. 8', '2004-01-12 10:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(539587, 54764, 6359, '<td valign="top">After dark?</td>', 'After dark?', '2004-01-12 10:31:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(539588, 54665, 6359, '<td valign="top">After dark?</td>', 'After dark?', '2004-01-12 10:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(539589, 54773, 6359, '<td valign="top">After dark?</td>', 'After dark?', '2004-01-12 10:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(539590, 54725, 6870, '<td valign="top">...until the phone rings! The phone is in such a strong position compositionally, my eyes ultimately end up switching from the man''s face to the phone and back again, so I find it an ironic device considering your title. LIghting is nice, though burnt out in places--on the book, for instance, but this is a nice shot with some very interesting dynamics taking place.</td>', '...until the phone rings! The phone is in such a strong position compositionally, my eyes ultimately end up switching from the man''s face to the phone and back again, so I find it an ironic device considering your title. LIghting is nice, though burnt out in places--on the book, for instance, but this is a nice shot with some very interesting dynamics taking place.', '2004-01-12 10:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(539591, 54201, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and good use of negative space.</td>', 'Nice composition and good use of negative space.', '2004-01-12 10:33:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(539592, 54542, 6870, '<td valign="top">The highway and motion blur lead my eye nicely to that marvelous sky! Fun stuff! 9</td>', 'The highway and motion blur lead my eye nicely to that marvelous sky! Fun stuff! 9', '2004-01-12 10:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(539593, 54575, 6359, '<td valign="top">Did you use a tripod.? if not, you needed one.</td>', 'Did you use a tripod.? if not, you needed one.', '2004-01-12 10:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(539594, 54594, 6870, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully dramatic idea. Composition is good. The ghostly daughter works quite nicely.</td>', 'Wonderfully dramatic idea. Composition is good. The ghostly daughter works quite nicely.', '2004-01-12 10:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(539595, 54575, 13136, '<td valign="top">Too blurry.</td>', 'Too blurry.', '2004-01-12 10:36:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(539596, 54665, 6870, '<td valign="top">I really like how the sillhouette of the human figure is not readily apparent. Nice use of mystery and mood. 9</td>', 'I really like how the sillhouette of the human figure is not readily apparent. Nice use of mystery and mood. 9', '2004-01-12 10:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(539597, 54690, 6359, '<td valign="top">After dark?</td>', 'After dark?', '2004-01-12 10:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(539598, 54467, 13136, '<td valign="top">Very interesting idea. The definition on the match heads is good.</td>', 'Very interesting idea. The definition on the match heads is good.', '2004-01-12 10:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(539600, 54772, 13136, '<td valign="top">Odd building. Made to be photographed. Nice angle on the shot.</td>', 'Odd building. Made to be photographed. Nice angle on the shot.', '2004-01-12 10:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(539601, 54464, 6870, '<td valign="top">Perhaps slighty overexposed, but an interesting shot of an interesting place. I like the misty feel to the water you''ve created. You may want to experiment with cropping to rid the image of anything distracting us from the falls.</td>', 'Perhaps slighty overexposed, but an interesting shot of an interesting place. I like the misty feel to the water you''ve created. You may want to experiment with cropping to rid the image of anything distracting us from the falls.', '2004-01-12 10:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(539604, 54614, 13136, '<td valign="top">I can''t really tell what I am looking at. A very busy picture.  I''d like to see how you made this.</td>', 'I can''t really tell what I am looking at. A very busy picture.  I''d like to see how you made this.', '2004-01-12 10:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(539605, 54742, 6870, '<td valign="top">The red bulb is in a strong position compositionally here. You may want to think about what I''m really supposed to be looking at. My eyes end up on the red bulb and the white light beneath it, but the fencing and snow provide lots of competition, so I''m not exactly sure what this photo is communicating and why. NIce, moody feel to it, too.</td>', 'The red bulb is in a strong position compositionally here. You may want to think about what I''m really supposed to be looking at. My eyes end up on the red bulb and the white light beneath it, but the fencing and snow provide lots of competition, so I''m not exactly sure what this photo is communicating and why. NIce, moody feel to it, too.', '2004-01-12 10:40:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(539608, 54560, 13136, '<td valign="top">What is it? Interesting effects, but I''m not sure what I''m looking at.</td>', 'What is it? Interesting effects, but I''m not sure what I''m looking at.', '2004-01-12 10:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(539609, 54542, 14068, '<td valign="top">Looks great, well done on the overall exposure and capturing that great sky. I like how the road bends and the contrast of colours. 9</td>', 'Looks great, well done on the overall exposure and capturing that great sky. I like how the road bends and the contrast of colours. 9', '2004-01-12 10:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(539610, 54767, 13136, '<td valign="top">Good night city shot. Makes me want to live there. I especially like how you caught the twin lights beamed into the sky.</td>', 'Good night city shot. Makes me want to live there. I especially like how you caught the twin lights beamed into the sky.', '2004-01-12 10:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(539611, 54201, 13136, '<td valign="top">Good study. Perfect lighting.</td>', 'Good study. Perfect lighting.', '2004-01-12 10:42:52.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(539617, 54721, 13136, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. San Antonio? Need one of the boats lit up and going by in the foreground.</td>', 'Nice shot. San Antonio? Need one of the boats lit up and going by in the foreground.', '2004-01-12 10:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(539650, 54178, 7969, '<td valign="top">I have a real personal envy of this shot, I tried several times to do a similar shot and could not get the lighting right,  you managed a very nice warm glow, well done.</td>', 'I have a real personal envy of this shot, I tried several times to do a similar shot and could not get the lighting right,  you managed a very nice warm glow, well done.', '2004-01-12 11:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(539651, 54668, 7969, '<td valign="top">Great lighting, composition and the smoke of course adds great depth and interest, tho it looks like he is thinking about eating the cig. vs. smoking it : ).</td>', 'Great lighting, composition and the smoke of course adds great depth and interest, tho it looks like he is thinking about eating the cig. vs. smoking it : ).', '2004-01-12 11:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(539654, 54725, 7907, '<td valign="top">I had to come back to this photo several times to look at it.  It is just a superb character study.  I keep thinking how much I''d like a picture this ''real'' of the people I love.  Well done!</td>', 'I had to come back to this photo several times to look at it.  It is just a superb character study.  I keep thinking how much I''d like a picture this ''real'' of the people I love.  Well done!', '2004-01-12 11:34:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(539656, 54668, 7907, '<td valign="top">This is my number 1 pic for this challenge to date.  It is striking and memorable. - Of course I am a person who is ferverently hoping I get to smoke in heaven since I''ve given up here!</td>', 'This is my number 1 pic for this challenge to date.  It is striking and memorable. - Of course I am a person who is ferverently hoping I get to smoke in heaven since I''ve given up here!', '2004-01-12 11:35:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(539657, 54627, 7969, '<td valign="top">Well the highest compliment I can give you is that this looks like a beguin shot, fabulous light, texture, mood, composition. Very well done, I expect a high finish for you.  (If this is a  benguin is this taken on the new 828?)</td>', 'Well the highest compliment I can give you is that this looks like a beguin shot, fabulous light, texture, mood, composition. Very well done, I expect a high finish for you.  (If this is a  benguin is this taken on the new 828?)', '2004-01-12 11:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(539658, 53986, 7907, '<td valign="top">This is very ethereal.  I love the way the rocks look very wet and smooth.  It is a beautiful shot.</td>', 'This is very ethereal.  I love the way the rocks look very wet and smooth.  It is a beautiful shot.', '2004-01-12 11:36:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(539659, 53986, 7969, '<td valign="top">What makes your shot IMO is the water and rocks right in the middle foreground of the shot, beautiful  light, texture, feel, a very high interest area.</td>', 'What makes your shot IMO is the water and rocks right in the middle foreground of the shot, beautiful  light, texture, feel, a very high interest area.', '2004-01-12 11:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(539701, 54576, 4008, '<td valign="top">not sharp</td>', 'not sharp', '2004-01-12 12:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(539703, 54717, 4008, '<td valign="top">I worked at a refinery for 8 years and this does appeal to me. I like the color and the reflections in the clouds. The image is not pin sharp, it does seem to suffer from compression, for example jagged edges on the big cooling tower on the right.</td>', 'I worked at a refinery for 8 years and this does appeal to me. I like the color and the reflections in the clouds. The image is not pin sharp, it does seem to suffer from compression, for example jagged edges on the big cooling tower on the right.', '2004-01-12 12:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(539708, 54672, 4008, '<td valign="top">I don''t know the surrounding, but was in not possible to choose a position without the disturbing building lights in the background ? Great soft flow of the fountain and the smooth water, while at the same time it is pinsharp.</td>', 'I don''t know the surrounding, but was in not possible to choose a position without the disturbing building lights in the background ? Great soft flow of the fountain and the smooth water, while at the same time it is pinsharp.', '2004-01-12 12:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(539709, 54758, 4008, '<td valign="top">not sharp</td>', 'not sharp', '2004-01-12 12:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(539712, 54657, 4008, '<td valign="top">Compositionwise I think you should have turned the camera more to the left, focussing totally on the bar. But I like the atmosphere here.</td>', 'Compositionwise I think you should have turned the camera more to the left, focussing totally on the bar. But I like the atmosphere here.', '2004-01-12 12:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(539721, 54721, 4008, '<td valign="top">Too much going on for my taste. I think if you would have included only the terrace with the colorful parasols, it would have been much better.</td>', 'Too much going on for my taste. I think if you would have included only the terrace with the colorful parasols, it would have been much better.', '2004-01-12 12:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(539723, 54605, 13136, '<td valign="top">Good shot. Clear and not overexposed.</td>', 'Good shot. Clear and not overexposed.', '2004-01-12 12:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(539725, 54458, 13136, '<td valign="top">I like the steam(?) over on the left side. The shot may be a bit overexposed, but that''s only my opinion.  I might have cropped the bottom up to the edge of the calm/moving water.</td>', 'I like the steam(?) over on the left side. The shot may be a bit overexposed, but that''s only my opinion.  I might have cropped the bottom up to the edge of the calm/moving water.', '2004-01-12 12:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(539726, 54758, 472, '<td valign="top">i''m guessing you didnt use a tripod.  very blurred unfortunately. looks like the scene had potential, tho</td>', 'i''m guessing you didnt use a tripod.  very blurred unfortunately. looks like the scene had potential, tho', '2004-01-12 12:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(539727, 54770, 472, '<td valign="top">severely underexposed.  use levels to fix.</td>', 'severely underexposed.  use levels to fix.', '2004-01-12 12:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(539732, 54719, 6999, '<td valign="top">Excellent DOF trick - and an excellent image all round, though perhaps not really within the idea of the challenge (you get a 9 nevertheless, just for its being wonderful). I rather think it might be too odd an image to score well, even if it fit the challenge perfectly - this comment is really only to explain what I''m presuming will be a poorer score than i personally think this deserves.</td>', 'Excellent DOF trick - and an excellent image all round, though perhaps not really within the idea of the challenge (you get a 9 nevertheless, just for its being wonderful). I rather think it might be too odd an image to score well, even if it fit the challenge perfectly - this comment is really only to explain what I''m presuming will be a poorer score than i personally think this deserves.', '2004-01-12 12:41:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(539733, 54458, 327, '<td valign="top">Classic shot...just beautiful. The lights are awesome. Congrast on a shot well done.</td>', 'Classic shot...just beautiful. The lights are awesome. Congrast on a shot well done.', '2004-01-12 12:41:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(539734, 54467, 327, '<td valign="top">LOL love the title. Good shot and wonderful colors.</td>', 'LOL love the title. Good shot and wonderful colors.', '2004-01-12 12:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(539735, 54716, 13136, '<td valign="top">Another one with the lights going the wrong way (only according to me, of course). I like the blue lines on the left side. Nice shot.</td>', 'Another one with the lights going the wrong way (only according to me, of course). I like the blue lines on the left side. Nice shot.', '2004-01-12 12:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(539736, 54760, 327, '<td valign="top">Maybe it''s me, but this looks like it''s listing to the right a bit..?? Beautiful building and nice lights.</td>', 'Maybe it''s me, but this looks like it''s listing to the right a bit..?? Beautiful building and nice lights.', '2004-01-12 12:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(539738, 54688, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. I think the it''s just a little bit soft. Still it''s intriguing to look at and has a very good feeling. Nice work, good dof.</td>', 'Nice shot. I think the it''s just a little bit soft. Still it''s intriguing to look at and has a very good feeling. Nice work, good dof.', '2004-01-12 12:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(539740, 53986, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. This is just beautifully shot.</td>', 'Nice shot. This is just beautifully shot.', '2004-01-12 12:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(539742, 54627, 6999, '<td valign="top">Like this very much ... with a couple of reservations: the sheer quantity of black to camera right - I appreciate the element of mystery, even of fear that it adds, but I wonder if some gentle illumination of that area might have added depth, especially given the edge lighting to whatever object that is that lead the eye into that area somewhat: I see the faintest impression of a wheel there, but it seems raised above the street. Not sure that information is what you were after conveying. Heaos more intersting tthan most images here though.</td>', 'Like this very much ... with a couple of reservations: the sheer quantity of black to camera right - I appreciate the element of mystery, even of fear that it adds, but I wonder if some gentle illumination of that area might have added depth, especially given the edge lighting to whatever object that is that lead the eye into that area somewhat: I see the faintest impression of a wheel there, but it seems raised above the street. Not sure that information is what you were after conveying. Heaos more intersting tthan most images here though.', '2004-01-12 12:45:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(539743, 54642, 327, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot. Huge monolithic piece of rock.</td>', 'Wonderful shot. Huge monolithic piece of rock.', '2004-01-12 12:45:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(539744, 54657, 327, '<td valign="top">Very nice night time shot.</td>', 'Very nice night time shot.', '2004-01-12 12:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(539745, 54488, 327, '<td valign="top">Really cool....creepy, dark and foreboding. Nice, nice focus. 9 from me.</td>', 'Really cool....creepy, dark and foreboding. Nice, nice focus. 9 from me.', '2004-01-12 12:47:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(539746, 54527, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good work - and excellent distribution of the weight of the image within the frame. The toning is interesting, and appropriate - connects with the ironwork of the structure. Such a familiar subject ... not quite sure if that adds or detracts for me though.</td>', 'Good work - and excellent distribution of the weight of the image within the frame. The toning is interesting, and appropriate - connects with the ironwork of the structure. Such a familiar subject ... not quite sure if that adds or detracts for me though.', '2004-01-12 12:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(539747, 54749, 327, '<td valign="top">Spectacular shot. Would of like more of the falls and less of the right side. Still this is so nice. Congrats. 8 from me.</td>', 'Spectacular shot. Would of like more of the falls and less of the right side. Still this is so nice. Congrats. 8 from me.', '2004-01-12 12:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(539748, 54608, 327, '<td valign="top">Unique shot. It''s kind of pretty and sure is a nice focus. Good going.</td>', 'Unique shot. It''s kind of pretty and sure is a nice focus. Good going.', '2004-01-12 12:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(539749, 54711, 327, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot and wonderful color. The tree is super for balance.</td>', 'Interesting shot and wonderful color. The tree is super for balance.', '2004-01-12 12:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(539750, 54665, 327, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I think this would of had a little more impact if she was move a little more in the light revealing more of her profile. Like this- 8 from me.</td>', 'Very nice. I think this would of had a little more impact if she was move a little more in the light revealing more of her profile. Like this- 8 from me.', '2004-01-12 12:51:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(539751, 54276, 327, '<td valign="top">Very nice and right on spot for the challenge. Cool blue and lights.</td>', 'Very nice and right on spot for the challenge. Cool blue and lights.', '2004-01-12 12:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(539752, 54613, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, really interesting buildings, lights and color. Nice work.</td>', 'Nice shot, really interesting buildings, lights and color. Nice work.', '2004-01-12 12:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(539753, 54725, 15642, '<td valign="top">Nice, but I wish foreground phone was eliminated.</td>', 'Nice, but I wish foreground phone was eliminated.', '2004-01-12 12:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(539755, 54712, 15642, '<td valign="top">Otherworldly. Very distinct.</td>', 'Otherworldly. Very distinct.', '2004-01-12 12:53:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(539757, 54576, 15642, '<td valign="top">Too fuzzy...</td>', 'Too fuzzy...', '2004-01-12 12:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(539758, 54730, 327, '<td valign="top">7 from me. It''s good, just a tad bit too dark. Still very nicely done.</td>', '7 from me. It''s good, just a tad bit too dark. Still very nicely done.', '2004-01-12 12:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(539759, 54760, 13136, '<td valign="top">The shadows cast by the lights add an eerie, dramatic effect.</td>', 'The shadows cast by the lights add an eerie, dramatic effect.', '2004-01-12 12:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(539760, 54645, 15642, '<td valign="top">Lacking interest.</td>', 'Lacking interest.', '2004-01-12 12:55:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(539763, 54276, 15642, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective.</td>', 'Interesting perspective.', '2004-01-12 12:55:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(539764, 54178, 15642, '<td valign="top">The Ents? Ya lost me, but nice shot.</td>', 'The Ents? Ya lost me, but nice shot.', '2004-01-12 12:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(539766, 54343, 13136, '<td valign="top">Cool lamp. I need one like that. Nice exposure, good lighting and composition.</td>', 'Cool lamp. I need one like that. Nice exposure, good lighting and composition.', '2004-01-12 12:56:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(539767, 54774, 327, '<td valign="top">I love diners and some day hope to shoot a whole series of them.Neat colors lights and focus. Good topic for the challenge. 8</td>', 'I love diners and some day hope to shoot a whole series of them.Neat colors lights and focus. Good topic for the challenge. 8', '2004-01-12 12:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(539768, 54613, 15642, '<td valign="top">Captures a frigid winter night nicely (unless this is San Antonio)...</td>', 'Captures a frigid winter night nicely (unless this is San Antonio)...', '2004-01-12 12:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(539769, 54771, 327, '<td valign="top">Stunning light and colors.</td>', 'Stunning light and colors.', '2004-01-12 12:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(539770, 54624, 13136, '<td valign="top">Not really "After Dark" when the sunlight is still visible. Nice colors and good silhouette.</td>', 'Not really "After Dark" when the sunlight is still visible. Nice colors and good silhouette.', '2004-01-12 12:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(539771, 54770, 15642, '<td valign="top">I think the title over-sells the shot a bit. Still, I like the lone freighter at dusk.</td>', 'I think the title over-sells the shot a bit. Still, I like the lone freighter at dusk.', '2004-01-12 12:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(539772, 54774, 13136, '<td valign="top">Glass, chrome and neon make for a nice night shot.</td>', 'Glass, chrome and neon make for a nice night shot.', '2004-01-12 12:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
