(540004, 54662, 9941, '<td valign="top">Right out of a Tim Burton movie!  Excellent image, intresting composition.  Medal worthy!</td>', 'Right out of a Tim Burton movie!  Excellent image, intresting composition.  Medal worthy!', '2004-01-12 14:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(540007, 54576, 9941, '<td valign="top">Good try, but too blurry.  I know how hard these shots are - I didn''t submit one for this challenge!</td>', 'Good try, but too blurry.  I know how hard these shots are - I didn''t submit one for this challenge!', '2004-01-12 15:02:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(540009, 54565, 9941, '<td valign="top">Nice idea!  I''''m not sure I like the  dark object in the foreground.</td>', 'Nice idea!  I''''m not sure I like the  dark object in the foreground.', '2004-01-12 15:04:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(540010, 54527, 9941, '<td valign="top">Wow, it must be nice having such interesting objects to photograph!  You''ll probably win a ribbon with this one!</td>', 'Wow, it must be nice having such interesting objects to photograph!  You''ll probably win a ribbon with this one!', '2004-01-12 15:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(540012, 54728, 9941, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot!  Good drama and focus.</td>', 'Very nice shot!  Good drama and focus.', '2004-01-12 15:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(540013, 54730, 9941, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, well executed.  It would be interesting to re-shoot this with a vibrant sky behind the windmill.</td>', 'Nice idea, well executed.  It would be interesting to re-shoot this with a vibrant sky behind the windmill.', '2004-01-12 15:07:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(540014, 54716, 9941, '<td valign="top">My first reaction is "not another highway shot," but you really stepped outside of the norm and created something unique.  The composition is espececially nice.</td>', 'My first reaction is "not another highway shot," but you really stepped outside of the norm and created something unique.  The composition is espececially nice.', '2004-01-12 15:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(540022, 54542, 3102, '<td valign="top">Very nice job with the long exposure!  I especially like the gradient in the sky in the background, and the fact that you can read the numbers on the road.  Too bad a plane flew by at this moment... that little distraction is the only thing keeping me from giving this a 10.</td>', 'Very nice job with the long exposure!  I especially like the gradient in the sky in the background, and the fact that you can read the numbers on the road.  Too bad a plane flew by at this moment... that little distraction is the only thing keeping me from giving this a 10.', '2004-01-12 15:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(540023, 54767, 3102, '<td valign="top">Nice job with the exposure!  I might have tilted it down just a smidge... but still a 9 in my book.</td>', 'Nice job with the exposure!  I might have tilted it down just a smidge... but still a 9 in my book.', '2004-01-12 15:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(540024, 54662, 3102, '<td valign="top">Quite the dramatic colors!  I love it!</td>', 'Quite the dramatic colors!  I love it!', '2004-01-12 15:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(540025, 54749, 3102, '<td valign="top">Been there many, many times -- it''s a great place to get night shots, as you have shown!  I might have panned down just a bit to provide a little more foreground and a little less sky, but this is still one of my favorites of the challenge.</td>', 'Been there many, many times -- it''s a great place to get night shots, as you have shown!  I might have panned down just a bit to provide a little more foreground and a little less sky, but this is still one of my favorites of the challenge.', '2004-01-12 15:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(540030, 54380, 2752, '<td valign="top">I rode on a 1946 red one in my younger years...happy to see they are making a comeback.  Your lighting here is good but wonder if a little higher would have shown the seat and far handle bar better.  Nice use of thirds.(6)</td>', 'I rode on a 1946 red one in my younger years...happy to see they are making a comeback.  Your lighting here is good but wonder if a little higher would have shown the seat and far handle bar better.  Nice use of thirds.(6)', '2004-01-12 15:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(540043, 54398, 327, '<td valign="top">Maybe just a bit too saturated..? Also the focus is somewhat soft. Your color is pretty and the idea is very good. Maybe you can shoot this again but tone it down a little bit. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Maybe just a bit too saturated..? Also the focus is somewhat soft. Your color is pretty and the idea is very good. Maybe you can shoot this again but tone it down a little bit. Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-01-12 15:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(540047, 54206, 327, '<td valign="top">Neat looking view of the moon. Not too bad but the lens flare and lack of detail on the moon is a little bother. On the other hand the branches in a ring are spectacular and make a natural frame around the moon. Interesting shot. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Neat looking view of the moon. Not too bad but the lens flare and lack of detail on the moon is a little bother. On the other hand the branches in a ring are spectacular and make a natural frame around the moon. Interesting shot. Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-01-12 15:39:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(540050, 54374, 327, '<td valign="top">Wonderful title and composition. The focus is just soft.</td>', 'Wonderful title and composition. The focus is just soft.', '2004-01-12 15:40:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(540053, 54742, 327, '<td valign="top">I like your idea but I think the composition has let your shot down. It''s very busy, snow/lights/white/red/leaves and a bit of chicken wire. I think if you had just picked one area to focus/ and crop it would of improved this good idea.</td>', 'I like your idea but I think the composition has let your shot down. It''s very busy, snow/lights/white/red/leaves and a bit of chicken wire. I think if you had just picked one area to focus/ and crop it would of improved this good idea.', '2004-01-12 15:43:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(540056, 54639, 327, '<td valign="top">Unsure of what this is..Car? It''s too abstract to distinguish. sorry.</td>', 'Unsure of what this is..Car? It''s too abstract to distinguish. sorry.', '2004-01-12 15:45:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(540087, 54665, 5158, '<td valign="top">Beautiful place captured in a beautiful scene. Well chosen title too. Like the colors and how the cloud with darknes come in form the top/back. The sharpness is great to, especially on the face.<br/>One of my favourits. Good luck!</td>', 'Beautiful place captured in a beautiful scene. Well chosen title too. Like the colors and how the cloud with darknes come in form the top/back. The sharpness is great to, especially on the face.One of my favourits. Good luck!', '2004-01-12 16:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(540095, 54717, 5158, '<td valign="top">I personaly like to look at these bright shinning plants very much: can''t take my eyes from them when I pass by. <br/>This picture stands out for its brilliance, the lights come out almost like diamonds. I like the clouds in the back, they give a wonderfull background.<br/>Acctually I was planning to make a simillar image too (not of such a great plant though) and the title would have been also "Nightshift". <br/>Good luck to you.</td>', 'I personaly like to look at these bright shinning plants very much: can''t take my eyes from them when I pass by. This picture stands out for its brilliance, the lights come out almost like diamonds. I like the clouds in the back, they give a wonderfull background.Acctually I was planning to make a simillar image too (not of such a great plant though) and the title would have been also "Nightshift". Good luck to you.', '2004-01-12 16:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(540098, 54725, 5158, '<td valign="top">Like the play of light and shadows and pose of this one. Also fits very well to the challenge.<br/>It''s just too bright and also could have been improved considerablly by moving the phone and other items away and place a cup of tea or glass of wine/whisky there.</td>', 'Like the play of light and shadows and pose of this one. Also fits very well to the challenge.It''s just too bright and also could have been improved considerablly by moving the phone and other items away and place a cup of tea or glass of wine/whisky there.', '2004-01-12 16:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(540151, 54374, 10869, '<td valign="top">too blurry, would have been better with focus made on something</td>', 'too blurry, would have been better with focus made on something', '2004-01-12 17:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(540195, 54466, 14614, '<td valign="top">Creative and nicely composed.  The closest streetlight competes for my attention and I think it distracts from your subjects.</td>', 'Creative and nicely composed.  The closest streetlight competes for my attention and I think it distracts from your subjects.', '2004-01-12 18:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(540197, 54354, 14614, '<td valign="top">Creative - like the blend of crisp and blurry people.  Intesting lighting (except for the top most light - too hot and distracting) all in all a captivating pic.</td>', 'Creative - like the blend of crisp and blurry people.  Intesting lighting (except for the top most light - too hot and distracting) all in all a captivating pic.', '2004-01-12 18:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(540198, 54605, 7966, '<td valign="top">great shot! but the moon could have been brighter</td>', 'great shot! but the moon could have been brighter', '2004-01-12 18:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(540201, 54744, 7966, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot, could have cropped a little off the top to make it looked a little more balanced... still a 10 in my book though</td>', 'beautiful shot, could have cropped a little off the top to make it looked a little more balanced... still a 10 in my book though', '2004-01-12 18:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
