(540295, 54178, 9939, '<td valign="top">Technical: fits the challenge. Exposure lighting composition focus all good.<br/> <br/>Personal: As tempting as it was to me to take a shot like this, I chose not to because I thought it wouldn''t be very compelling- and that''s how I feel about this image. I''d love to see some more imagination!<br/> <br/>My vote: 4<br/></td>', 'Technical: fits the challenge. Exposure lighting composition focus all good. Personal: As tempting as it was to me to take a shot like this, I chose not to because I thought it wouldn''t be very compelling- and that''s how I feel about this image. I''d love to see some more imagination! My vote: 4', '2004-01-12 20:45:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(540297, 54768, 9939, '<td valign="top">Technical: fits the challenge. Exposure lighting composition focus all good.<br/> <br/>Personal: As tempting as it was to me to take a shot like this, I chose not to because I thought it wouldn''t be very compelling- and that''s how I feel about this image. It''s compounded by the fact that the light source is way too bright and distracting for me. I''d love to see some more imagination!<br/> <br/>My vote: 3<br/></td>', 'Technical: fits the challenge. Exposure lighting composition focus all good. Personal: As tempting as it was to me to take a shot like this, I chose not to because I thought it wouldn''t be very compelling- and that''s how I feel about this image. It''s compounded by the fact that the light source is way too bright and distracting for me. I''d love to see some more imagination! My vote: 3', '2004-01-12 20:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(540299, 54374, 9939, '<td valign="top">Technical: fits the challenge. Exposure lighting composition good, focus looks off.<br/> <br/>Personal: As tempting as it was to me to take a shot like this, I chose not to because I thought it wouldn''t be very compelling- and that''s how I feel about this image. This is compounded by the lack of focus. I''d love to see some more imagination!<br/> <br/>My vote: 3<br/></td>', 'Technical: fits the challenge. Exposure lighting composition good, focus looks off. Personal: As tempting as it was to me to take a shot like this, I chose not to because I thought it wouldn''t be very compelling- and that''s how I feel about this image. This is compounded by the lack of focus. I''d love to see some more imagination! My vote: 3', '2004-01-12 20:47:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(540302, 54206, 9939, '<td valign="top">Technical: fits the challenge. Exposure lighting composition focus all very good.<br/> <br/>Personal: As tempting as it was to me to take a shot like this, I chose not to because I thought it wouldn''t be very compelling- I''ve voted other similar images in this challenge down for this reason, but this shot actually works very well. The focus is sharp and the image is very clean and smooth looking, the exposure and composition are perfect, and great mood is created here. Nice job where others failed!!<br/> <br/>My vote: 8<br/></td>', 'Technical: fits the challenge. Exposure lighting composition focus all very good. Personal: As tempting as it was to me to take a shot like this, I chose not to because I thought it wouldn''t be very compelling- I''ve voted other similar images in this challenge down for this reason, but this shot actually works very well. The focus is sharp and the image is very clean and smooth looking, the exposure and composition are perfect, and great mood is created here. Nice job where others failed!! My vote: 8', '2004-01-12 20:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(540306, 54624, 7556, '<td valign="top">That is nice...Great silhouette and the sky is just perfect, good job!</td>', 'That is nice...Great silhouette and the sky is just perfect, good job!', '2004-01-12 20:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(540307, 54542, 7556, '<td valign="top">Pretty picture...</td>', 'Pretty picture...', '2004-01-12 20:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(540312, 54599, 14614, '<td valign="top">The monochromatic feel is great.  The stars add sparkle.  Well done.  One of my pics for a ribbon. 9</td>', 'The monochromatic feel is great.  The stars add sparkle.  Well done.  One of my pics for a ribbon. 9', '2004-01-12 20:59:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(540314, 54398, 14614, '<td valign="top">Excellent color - very dramatic composition (could have been taken night or day??) One of my favs in the competition 9</td>', 'Excellent color - very dramatic composition (could have been taken night or day??) One of my favs in the competition 9', '2004-01-12 21:00:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(540315, 54759, 14614, '<td valign="top">nicley composed, interesting sky.  Good decision about the boarder - this shot is helped by it - somehow the orange on the right that touches the orange in the photo bothers me (slight negative)  One of my picks for a ribbon. 9</td>', 'nicley composed, interesting sky.  Good decision about the boarder - this shot is helped by it - somehow the orange on the right that touches the orange in the photo bothers me (slight negative)  One of my picks for a ribbon. 9', '2004-01-12 21:01:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(540316, 54560, 14614, '<td valign="top">Seems like this could have been taken either day or night.  That said, engaging image and wild colors.  Well done.</td>', 'Seems like this could have been taken either day or night.  That said, engaging image and wild colors.  Well done.', '2004-01-12 21:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(540318, 53919, 14614, '<td valign="top">Seems like this could be night OR day.. that said - fabulous color and composition.  The green thing is a bit distracting.  One of my favs. 8</td>', 'Seems like this could be night OR day.. that said - fabulous color and composition.  The green thing is a bit distracting.  One of my favs. 8', '2004-01-12 21:02:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(540319, 54668, 14614, '<td valign="top">Very creative - the glowing cigarette adds interest, the siloette against the backlit smoke makes the shot.  Well done 8</td>', 'Very creative - the glowing cigarette adds interest, the siloette against the backlit smoke makes the shot.  Well done 8', '2004-01-12 21:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(540320, 54627, 14614, '<td valign="top">Great mood in this shot.  I like how little light there is and that you used it very well.  One of my favs for this competition 8</td>', 'Great mood in this shot.  I like how little light there is and that you used it very well.  One of my favs for this competition 8', '2004-01-12 21:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(540331, 54117, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot! My favorite light is on that little tower/turret. Below seems a little bright. I like the tree on the left. Have you experimented with your composition to put that turret on a "third"? It may make the composition a bit stronger. Nice blue colors!</td>', 'Very interesting shot! My favorite light is on that little tower/turret. Below seems a little bright. I like the tree on the left. Have you experimented with your composition to put that turret on a "third"? It may make the composition a bit stronger. Nice blue colors!', '2004-01-12 21:25:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(540332, 54764, 6870, '<td valign="top">There is such wonderful drama in the sky! I wish the birds were in focus, but the composition is quite nice and a bit unique.</td>', 'There is such wonderful drama in the sky! I wish the birds were in focus, but the composition is quite nice and a bit unique.', '2004-01-12 21:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(540333, 54730, 6870, '<td valign="top">I really enjoy windmills and never tire of seeing them in photographs. The tilt here adds interest, but I''m a little unsure as to why, exactly, it is there. Nice sillhouette and lovely tones here.</td>', 'I really enjoy windmills and never tire of seeing them in photographs. The tilt here adds interest, but I''m a little unsure as to why, exactly, it is there. Nice sillhouette and lovely tones here.', '2004-01-12 21:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(540335, 54398, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very unusual orchid photo. The colors and tones are very lovely, though the tonal range could perhaps be just a tad wider--brighter brights and darker darks (on the flower itself). Very lovely photo! 8</td>', 'Very unusual orchid photo. The colors and tones are very lovely, though the tonal range could perhaps be just a tad wider--brighter brights and darker darks (on the flower itself). Very lovely photo! 8', '2004-01-12 21:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(540337, 54758, 6870, '<td valign="top">This image is a bit blurry, but the composition is very strong, and the idea is marvelous.</td>', 'This image is a bit blurry, but the composition is very strong, and the idea is marvelous.', '2004-01-12 21:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(540339, 54639, 6870, '<td valign="top">The parts of this image that are in sharp focus are in the upper left, but the composition and lighting are quite nice. I like how complex everything looks.</td>', 'The parts of this image that are in sharp focus are in the upper left, but the composition and lighting are quite nice. I like how complex everything looks.', '2004-01-12 21:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(540343, 54607, 6870, '<td valign="top">Interesting lighting makes this photo stand out as unique and special. Although the brightest part of the photo is the closest dummy''s belly, my eyes still end up at his head--then feel free to move around and explore. I''m really sure where to look, or what I should think, but I like the mood of the image and its weird quirkiness. 8</td>', 'Interesting lighting makes this photo stand out as unique and special. Although the brightest part of the photo is the closest dummy''s belly, my eyes still end up at his head--then feel free to move around and explore. I''m really sure where to look, or what I should think, but I like the mood of the image and its weird quirkiness. 8', '2004-01-12 21:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(540345, 54657, 6870, '<td valign="top">A very pleasant, everyday (or everynight) scene. Composition is strong, and your subject is interesting. 8</td>', 'A very pleasant, everyday (or everynight) scene. Composition is strong, and your subject is interesting. 8', '2004-01-12 21:35:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(540347, 54276, 6870, '<td valign="top">This looks like a Sci-fi movie! I like the contrasty tones. Nice angle of the building, too.</td>', 'This looks like a Sci-fi movie! I like the contrasty tones. Nice angle of the building, too.', '2004-01-12 21:36:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(540350, 54736, 6870, '<td valign="top">Your composition is strong with the tree at the upper left node. The lighting seems quite harsh, though. The tree has an interesting texture.</td>', 'Your composition is strong with the tree at the upper left node. The lighting seems quite harsh, though. The tree has an interesting texture.', '2004-01-12 21:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(540352, 54749, 6870, '<td valign="top">Niagra Falls with hoarfrost! Lovely! Nice point of view, though I do wish I could see either more of the falls or less of the negative space behind, which I don''t feel is accomplishing a lot. Perhaps just a simple closer crop would help. I love the misty feel of the falls, and the foreground provides a wonderful lead-in to the rest of the scene.</td>', 'Niagra Falls with hoarfrost! Lovely! Nice point of view, though I do wish I could see either more of the falls or less of the negative space behind, which I don''t feel is accomplishing a lot. Perhaps just a simple closer crop would help. I love the misty feel of the falls, and the foreground provides a wonderful lead-in to the rest of the scene.', '2004-01-12 21:38:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(540355, 54514, 6870, '<td valign="top">Ah yes. The Gathering of the Shoes. We have such rituals in my neighborhood, too. Well, not really. The bright light in the center really grabs my attention. So much so that it is difficult to make my eyes stray anywhere else. This is a puzzling scene, and I''m not sure what they''re doing. But you''ve captured their very earnest faces, so I find myself really wanting to explore what''s going on.</td>', 'Ah yes. The Gathering of the Shoes. We have such rituals in my neighborhood, too. Well, not really. The bright light in the center really grabs my attention. So much so that it is difficult to make my eyes stray anywhere else. This is a puzzling scene, and I''m not sure what they''re doing. But you''ve captured their very earnest faces, so I find myself really wanting to explore what''s going on.', '2004-01-12 21:40:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(540357, 54743, 6870, '<td valign="top">This is quite noisy, and I''m not sure the grain it helps the photo. But the composition is very strong, and the lines and sillhouette are very engaging and delightful.</td>', 'This is quite noisy, and I''m not sure the grain it helps the photo. But the composition is very strong, and the lines and sillhouette are very engaging and delightful.', '2004-01-12 21:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(540358, 54749, 10419, '<td valign="top">Superb shot. Almost magical</td>', 'Superb shot. Almost magical', '2004-01-12 21:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(540362, 54336, 10419, '<td valign="top">Very creative. Beautiful use of lights and shadows. Nice vertical composition. Love the warm golden colour.</td>', 'Very creative. Beautiful use of lights and shadows. Nice vertical composition. Love the warm golden colour.', '2004-01-12 21:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(540363, 54553, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice symmetry. It works well here. This image has a pleasant balance and tone to it. You might consider cropping it just a tad closer.</td>', 'Nice symmetry. It works well here. This image has a pleasant balance and tone to it. You might consider cropping it just a tad closer.', '2004-01-12 21:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(540366, 54712, 10419, '<td valign="top">Interesting colours. The green looks almost eery. Just beautiful.</td>', 'Interesting colours. The green looks almost eery. Just beautiful.', '2004-01-12 21:43:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(540367, 54458, 10419, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful colours. Good quality image for sure.</td>', 'Very beautiful colours. Good quality image for sure.', '2004-01-12 21:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(540368, 54775, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very interesting image. A unique concept and you capture some really ''cool'' textures here! Very strong composition with the moon at upper left.</td>', 'Very interesting image. A unique concept and you capture some really ''cool'' textures here! Very strong composition with the moon at upper left.', '2004-01-12 21:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(540369, 54458, 6870, '<td valign="top">What is that ghost-like thing on the bridge there at the left? Very groovy shot! The water is magical, and contrasts with the harder lines of the city so nicely! Congratulations on a wonderful photo. 10</td>', 'What is that ghost-like thing on the bridge there at the left? Very groovy shot! The water is magical, and contrasts with the harder lines of the city so nicely! Congratulations on a wonderful photo. 10', '2004-01-12 21:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(540370, 54553, 10419, '<td valign="top">Very pretty. Nice and clean night shot. It looks tiny bit crooked at the top (it leans towards the right). And my eyes are drawn to the centre hot spot. Still think it''s very nice shot.</td>', 'Very pretty. Nice and clean night shot. It looks tiny bit crooked at the top (it leans towards the right). And my eyes are drawn to the centre hot spot. Still think it''s very nice shot.', '2004-01-12 21:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(540371, 54705, 6870, '<td valign="top">Lots of drama in the sky here! I like the sense that the skiiers are so small in their environment.</td>', 'Lots of drama in the sky here! I like the sense that the skiiers are so small in their environment.', '2004-01-12 21:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(540372, 54721, 6870, '<td valign="top">A bit busy, but I really like your lighting and your use of the curve of the river.</td>', 'A bit busy, but I really like your lighting and your use of the curve of the river.', '2004-01-12 21:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(540373, 54671, 6870, '<td valign="top">Hey, but she''s reading--and that can''t be bad! Nice capture. Lighting is very nice; you are able to avoid harsh lights. Very pleasant image.</td>', 'Hey, but she''s reading--and that can''t be bad! Nice capture. Lighting is very nice; you are able to avoid harsh lights. Very pleasant image.', '2004-01-12 21:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(540374, 54662, 10419, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful. I love the way the clouds are in motion. Slight rotation to the left would fix the leaning of the building. Colours look very natural. Very nice shot.</td>', 'Very beautiful. I love the way the clouds are in motion. Slight rotation to the left would fix the leaning of the building. Colours look very natural. Very nice shot.', '2004-01-12 21:47:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(540375, 54338, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice pose, and nifty eyes on this beast.</td>', 'Nice pose, and nifty eyes on this beast.', '2004-01-12 21:47:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(540376, 54744, 10419, '<td valign="top">Very pretty. Enchanted forest... The snow specks are a bit distracting from the smoothness of the winter scape, but you couldn''t do much about that. Nice duotone colour.</td>', 'Very pretty. Enchanted forest... The snow specks are a bit distracting from the smoothness of the winter scape, but you couldn''t do much about that. Nice duotone colour.', '2004-01-12 21:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(540377, 53986, 10419, '<td valign="top">Great composition. The water looks so misty, so beautiful. Very nice shot.</td>', 'Great composition. The water looks so misty, so beautiful. Very nice shot.', '2004-01-12 21:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(540379, 54743, 13772, '<td valign="top">I like the way you captured the moon throught the tree limbs. The picture looks a little grainy. I still like it.</td>', 'I like the way you captured the moon throught the tree limbs. The picture looks a little grainy. I still like it.', '2004-01-12 21:49:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(540380, 54605, 6870, '<td valign="top">Yep. That''s the cheese I saw in the sky that gave life to my shot, too. Nice moon shot. The focus is a bit soft, and the tones could perhaps use some widening (brigher brights, darker shadows), but it certainly belongs in the center, and it is an accomplishment just to get it! I''d be interested to know what equipment you used to capture this!</td>', 'Yep. That''s the cheese I saw in the sky that gave life to my shot, too. Nice moon shot. The focus is a bit soft, and the tones could perhaps use some widening (brigher brights, darker shadows), but it certainly belongs in the center, and it is an accomplishment just to get it! I''d be interested to know what equipment you used to capture this!', '2004-01-12 21:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(540381, 54688, 10419, '<td valign="top">Just love this. Such a mysterious path. Just gorgeous.</td>', 'Just love this. Such a mysterious path. Just gorgeous.', '2004-01-12 21:50:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(540382, 54771, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot. The bright lights at left upstage the other objects in the frame just a little. This is a marvelous time of day to shoot, when the lighting is very engaging.</td>', 'Very interesting shot. The bright lights at left upstage the other objects in the frame just a little. This is a marvelous time of day to shoot, when the lighting is very engaging.', '2004-01-12 21:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(540383, 54665, 10419, '<td valign="top">This is very well done. Bold siluette, yet you can see the person''s eyelashes and other details of the face. The colours are very nice contrast to the black shapes. Just love it.</td>', 'This is very well done. Bold siluette, yet you can see the person''s eyelashes and other details of the face. The colours are very nice contrast to the black shapes. Just love it.', '2004-01-12 21:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(540384, 54613, 6870, '<td valign="top">Another cold day, it appears. I love the steam coming out of the buildings! NIce, balanced composition and lovely colors. 9</td>', 'Another cold day, it appears. I love the steam coming out of the buildings! NIce, balanced composition and lovely colors. 9', '2004-01-12 21:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(540385, 54712, 13772, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast and the wind must of been calm to get such a nice reflection. Great picture.</td>', 'Nice contrast and the wind must of been calm to get such a nice reflection. Great picture.', '2004-01-12 21:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(540386, 54772, 10419, '<td valign="top">Interesting dynamic of shpaes. It just somehow splits the image in two uneven halves. Work on your composition of angles. But still very nice shot.</td>', 'Interesting dynamic of shpaes. It just somehow splits the image in two uneven halves. Work on your composition of angles. But still very nice shot.', '2004-01-12 21:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(540387, 54642, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very intriguining shot! The light at the base is perhaps a tad too bright,but the light on the formation itself is really nice, especially on top. Composition is strong; my eyes do end up on the top of the formation, that I want to explore further.</td>', 'Very intriguining shot! The light at the base is perhaps a tad too bright,but the light on the formation itself is really nice, especially on top. Composition is strong; my eyes do end up on the top of the formation, that I want to explore further.', '2004-01-12 21:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(540388, 54767, 10419, '<td valign="top">Looks like Santa''s village :-)) Nice lights. It''s nice aerial view, but it lacks a point of interest (no spot to rest your eyes on).</td>', 'Looks like Santa''s village :-)) Nice lights. It''s nice aerial view, but it lacks a point of interest (no spot to rest your eyes on).', '2004-01-12 21:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(540390, 54488, 10419, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition and viewpoint. Good clarity for a night shot.</td>', 'Very nice composition and viewpoint. Good clarity for a night shot.', '2004-01-12 21:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(540391, 54206, 10419, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shapes. Love the monotone colours as well. It adds to the eeryness of the night. Too bad about the moon ghost (slightly different positioning of the camera would have fixed it).  Also, vertical orientation of the photograph would ad dynamic to it, with darkenss below and moon shining above. Still interesting image to look at.</td>', 'Very interesting shapes. Love the monotone colours as well. It adds to the eeryness of the night. Too bad about the moon ghost (slightly different positioning of the camera would have fixed it).  Also, vertical orientation of the photograph would ad dynamic to it, with darkenss below and moon shining above. Still interesting image to look at.', '2004-01-12 21:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(540393, 54380, 10419, '<td valign="top">This is interesting perspective. It almost looks like a miniature motorcycle (or is it real one?) Hard to tell, which is the interesting part of it. Nice lighting. The snow adds nice sparkle to the whole photo.</td>', 'This is interesting perspective. It almost looks like a miniature motorcycle (or is it real one?) Hard to tell, which is the interesting part of it. Nice lighting. The snow adds nice sparkle to the whole photo.', '2004-01-12 21:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(540395, 54766, 10419, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done portrait. Very classy. Great lighting. I love the way the skin interacts with the darkness. Great photo.</td>', 'Beautifully done portrait. Very classy. Great lighting. I love the way the skin interacts with the darkness. Great photo.', '2004-01-12 21:58:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(540398, 54639, 10419, '<td valign="top">Behind the scenes of what? It is really hard to tell what I am looking at. A bit of brightening would help.</td>', 'Behind the scenes of what? It is really hard to tell what I am looking at. A bit of brightening would help.', '2004-01-12 22:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(540400, 54727, 10419, '<td valign="top">Nice shape and neon colour. Too tightly cropped. Sorry, but not overly interesting.</td>', 'Nice shape and neon colour. Too tightly cropped. Sorry, but not overly interesting.', '2004-01-12 22:01:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(540403, 54672, 10419, '<td valign="top">Love the title. It fits really well. Love the sense of humour in it. The composition here is very nice. It ads depth and scope to the photo. The colours are kind of drabby, so maybe b&amp;w would have just emphasize the interesting shapes. Great photo.</td>', 'Love the title. It fits really well. Love the sense of humour in it. The composition here is very nice. It ads depth and scope to the photo. The colours are kind of drabby, so maybe b&w would have just emphasize the interesting shapes. Great photo.', '2004-01-12 22:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(540406, 54614, 10419, '<td valign="top">Interesting eery image. The person or ghost is nice addition to otherwise smudgy shot. How did you achieve this artistic look? It is very interesting.</td>', 'Interesting eery image. The person or ghost is nice addition to otherwise smudgy shot. How did you achieve this artistic look? It is very interesting.', '2004-01-12 22:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(540407, 54725, 13772, '<td valign="top">Good contrast, the light is a little harsh on the book and a little on the arm. Maybe you should have left the stuff off the table. It is a little distracting. I like the overall feeling I get when I look at the picture though. Good job.</td>', 'Good contrast, the light is a little harsh on the book and a little on the arm. Maybe you should have left the stuff off the table. It is a little distracting. I like the overall feeling I get when I look at the picture though. Good job.', '2004-01-12 22:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(540408, 54711, 10419, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast between nature vs. civilization. Lovely sunset colours.</td>', 'Nice contrast between nature vs. civilization. Lovely sunset colours.', '2004-01-12 22:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(540412, 54599, 10419, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous shot. The stars are just amazing. It looks like a miniature landscape in some artificial world. Very beautiful, almost looks unreal. Love the bluish tones. Really nice photo.</td>', 'Gorgeous shot. The stars are just amazing. It looks like a miniature landscape in some artificial world. Very beautiful, almost looks unreal. Love the bluish tones. Really nice photo.', '2004-01-12 22:05:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(540414, 54276, 10419, '<td valign="top">Great architectual night shot. Just enough light and darkness to create good contrast. Love the lines in the image. It could have been rotated slightly to the right. Otherwise, well done.</td>', 'Great architectual night shot. Just enough light and darkness to create good contrast. Love the lines in the image. It could have been rotated slightly to the right. Otherwise, well done.', '2004-01-12 22:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(540418, 54668, 10419, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot. Love the red glow on the cigarette. Nice siluetted image. I would have cropped off the right side of the photo a bit. The smoke creates interesting eery texture. Well done.</td>', 'Very cool shot. Love the red glow on the cigarette. Nice siluetted image. I would have cropped off the right side of the photo a bit. The smoke creates interesting eery texture. Well done.', '2004-01-12 22:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(540422, 54627, 10419, '<td valign="top">This is very well composed. The path leads you into the light. Beautifull b&amp;w photography. The star effect is nice touch to otherwise simple image. Very beautiful. It makes you guess what is in the darkness. Is this in Prague by any chance?</td>', 'This is very well composed. The path leads you into the light. Beautifull b&w photography. The star effect is nice touch to otherwise simple image. Very beautiful. It makes you guess what is in the darkness. Is this in Prague by any chance?', '2004-01-12 22:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
