(540503, 54542, 5044, '<td valign="top">Very well composed. Normally, shots of car lights bore me, but this one has so many elements that just draw you in. The lights, the numbers on the road, the sunset, the town, the airplane? Very well done and one of my top picks. 10</td>', 'Very well composed. Normally, shots of car lights bore me, but this one has so many elements that just draw you in. The lights, the numbers on the road, the sunset, the town, the airplane? Very well done and one of my top picks. 10', '2004-01-12 22:45:51.000000', NULL, 1),
