(540506, 54523, 5044, '<td valign="top">I love the starburst from the lights. Did you use a filter or just a long exposure? The comp works very well as well. I find the picture has a very old fashioned feel about it. Well done. 8</td>', 'I love the starburst from the lights. Did you use a filter or just a long exposure? The comp works very well as well. I find the picture has a very old fashioned feel about it. Well done. 8', '2004-01-12 22:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
