(541094, 54639, 14620, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, this is too dark.  I can''t tell what it is I''m looking at other than it has green and red lights.  Might try a little better lighting next time.  Just my opinion though. :)</td>', 'Unfortunately, this is too dark.  I can''t tell what it is I''m looking at other than it has green and red lights.  Might try a little better lighting next time.  Just my opinion though. :)', '2004-01-13 12:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
