(541186, 54688, 11155, '<td valign="top">I really like the eeriness of this image.  Shadows are great as is the composition.  Not sure about the orange lighting, I may have tried using a different white balance setting, if possible.  Nice work.</td>', 'I really like the eeriness of this image.  Shadows are great as is the composition.  Not sure about the orange lighting, I may have tried using a different white balance setting, if possible.  Nice work.', '2004-01-13 14:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
