(541515, 54534, 15574, '<td valign="top">nice</td>', 'nice', '2004-01-13 20:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(541552, 54727, 14614, '<td valign="top">Nicely framed and interesting capture of an "icon" image - it has an abstract quality to it.  Hard to tell if it''s the glow of the neon but it seems a bit fuzzy??</td>', 'Nicely framed and interesting capture of an "icon" image - it has an abstract quality to it.  Hard to tell if it''s the glow of the neon but it seems a bit fuzzy??', '2004-01-13 21:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(541564, 54178, 4793, '<td valign="top">Beautiful</td>', 'Beautiful', '2004-01-13 22:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(541569, 54772, 4793, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition and colors, very nice shot.</td>', 'Beautiful composition and colors, very nice shot.', '2004-01-13 22:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(541571, 54773, 4793, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2004-01-13 22:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(541573, 54599, 4793, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, good comp and color.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, good comp and color.', '2004-01-13 22:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(541653, 54599, 15413, '<td valign="top">What a great photo! I would love to see a brief explanation on how you did it.</td>', 'What a great photo! I would love to see a brief explanation on how you did it.', '2004-01-14 00:13:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(541704, 54662, 15421, '<td valign="top">first place!</td>', 'first place!', '2004-01-14 00:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(541780, 54688, 325, '<td valign="top">Nice, I like the spooky effect. The light color is very interesting. There''s a motivational saying somewhere just waiting to be stamped to the bottom of this photo. It also looks like a scene out of a movie, that''s why I like it, I''m half expecting a good story if I could just see it in video, there''s something interesting in these woods isn''t there, and something''s gonna happen on that path. Composition is slightly non-standard which works for me.</td>', 'Nice, I like the spooky effect. The light color is very interesting. There''s a motivational saying somewhere just waiting to be stamped to the bottom of this photo. It also looks like a scene out of a movie, that''s why I like it, I''m half expecting a good story if I could just see it in video, there''s something interesting in these woods isn''t there, and something''s gonna happen on that path. Composition is slightly non-standard which works for me.', '2004-01-14 01:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(541785, 54261, 325, '<td valign="top">Nice, it''s very abstract, I know exactly what I''m looking at but my brain still keeps trying to figure it out. Texture of the water plus the dash board creates a mesmerizing effect. This is a hard one to pull off because it''s so "everyday" but I think you did it.</td>', 'Nice, it''s very abstract, I know exactly what I''m looking at but my brain still keeps trying to figure it out. Texture of the water plus the dash board creates a mesmerizing effect. This is a hard one to pull off because it''s so "everyday" but I think you did it.', '2004-01-14 01:22:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(541791, 54599, 325, '<td valign="top">Absolutely stunning. Love this photo, the colors are just awesome and it''s still feels crystal clear. One thing I like the photo feels like it''s part of a story, like there''s something happening, going to happen, or has happened - gives a little suspense to it. Composition and exposure are excellent. Excellent low light picture.</td>', 'Absolutely stunning. Love this photo, the colors are just awesome and it''s still feels crystal clear. One thing I like the photo feels like it''s part of a story, like there''s something happening, going to happen, or has happened - gives a little suspense to it. Composition and exposure are excellent. Excellent low light picture.', '2004-01-14 01:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(541804, 53986, 325, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, otherworldy photo. Makes me imagine some magical time that we never see but actually exists very briefly at night. Composition, exposure, and clarity is great. I knocked of 1 point and gave you a 9 because the horizon line looks slightly tilted to me. Sorry if it isn''t! It may also be an optical effect of the little peninsula, but I stared at it for awhile and it doesn''t look straight to me. Very cool though, they could have put this scene in Lord of the Rings.</td>', 'Beautiful, otherworldy photo. Makes me imagine some magical time that we never see but actually exists very briefly at night. Composition, exposure, and clarity is great. I knocked of 1 point and gave you a 9 because the horizon line looks slightly tilted to me. Sorry if it isn''t! It may also be an optical effect of the little peninsula, but I stared at it for awhile and it doesn''t look straight to me. Very cool though, they could have put this scene in Lord of the Rings.', '2004-01-14 01:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(541807, 54627, 325, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, exposure, and the cool effect on the light. Composition is well done, especially with the low light, you did a good job using the street to draw the eye into the light. Exposure is just right.</td>', 'I like the composition, exposure, and the cool effect on the light. Composition is well done, especially with the low light, you did a good job using the street to draw the eye into the light. Exposure is just right.', '2004-01-14 01:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(541869, 54594, 10170, '<td valign="top">Has to be the most emotionally strong photo I''ve seen in a very long time.</td>', 'Has to be the most emotionally strong photo I''ve seen in a very long time.', '2004-01-14 02:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(541871, 54668, 10170, '<td valign="top">Excellent.  I love the blue of the smoke contrasted with the red of the cigarette, and the whole silhouette thing in general.  10</td>', 'Excellent.  I love the blue of the smoke contrasted with the red of the cigarette, and the whole silhouette thing in general.  10', '2004-01-14 02:13:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(541872, 54688, 10170, '<td valign="top">Quite beautiful.</td>', 'Quite beautiful.', '2004-01-14 02:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(541873, 54631, 10170, '<td valign="top">Cute.  Very nice capture of a good emotion.</td>', 'Cute.  Very nice capture of a good emotion.', '2004-01-14 02:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(541877, 54671, 10170, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting as it has given real feeling to this ..... and memories of years gone by.</td>', 'Excellent lighting as it has given real feeling to this ..... and memories of years gone by.', '2004-01-14 02:22:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(541879, 54766, 10170, '<td valign="top">Love the lighting here, it has worked very well indeed.  Great choice of model also.</td>', 'Love the lighting here, it has worked very well indeed.  Great choice of model also.', '2004-01-14 02:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(541906, 54542, 12802, '<td valign="top">Very nice long exposure here!  I like the long lines, too many are done over a short period of time. Also like the sky, good different colours here.  9</td>', 'Very nice long exposure here!  I like the long lines, too many are done over a short period of time. Also like the sky, good different colours here.  9', '2004-01-14 03:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(541907, 54593, 12802, '<td valign="top">Think the big white dieplay along this spoils the shot, ask them to take it down...<br/> <br/>The large R with the lighting around it is brilliant, really looks like an old cinema. 8</td>', 'Think the big white dieplay along this spoils the shot, ask them to take it down... The large R with the lighting around it is brilliant, really looks like an old cinema. 8', '2004-01-14 03:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(541908, 54599, 12802, '<td valign="top">Such a nice picture here, the clarity is really good.  (Looks like a wee hot spot in the middle of the picture though)</td>', 'Such a nice picture here, the clarity is really good.  (Looks like a wee hot spot in the middle of the picture though)', '2004-01-14 03:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(541912, 54749, 12802, '<td valign="top">Nice long exposure on the water here, the colours on the plant? at the front are a bit boring to look at though.  Well, suppose it all is the same colour so there isn''t much you could do about it.  8</td>', 'Nice long exposure on the water here, the colours on the plant? at the front are a bit boring to look at though.  Well, suppose it all is the same colour so there isn''t much you could do about it.  8', '2004-01-14 04:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(541914, 54716, 12802, '<td valign="top">Good shot at the long exposure, you could have benefitted from taking a longer exposure though. The lines look too short.  7</td>', 'Good shot at the long exposure, you could have benefitted from taking a longer exposure though. The lines look too short.  7', '2004-01-14 04:03:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(541917, 54631, 12802, '<td valign="top">Really like this, the expression on her face here. It doesn''t looked posed which is always a bonus!<br/> <br/>The lighting is really good, did you put another light on the front of the book to highlight the skull and crossbones?  10</td>', 'Really like this, the expression on her face here. It doesn''t looked posed which is always a bonus! The lighting is really good, did you put another light on the front of the book to highlight the skull and crossbones?  10', '2004-01-14 04:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(541929, 54725, 12802, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, wasn''t what I was expecting from this challenge but it meets the challenge well.  He looks comfortable reading here, the book though seems a little overexposed.  I like how the telephone has been added, shows me that he''s thought of everything so that he doesn''t have to get up iof it goes...  A very good shot! 9</td>', 'I like this shot, wasn''t what I was expecting from this challenge but it meets the challenge well.  He looks comfortable reading here, the book though seems a little overexposed.  I like how the telephone has been added, shows me that he''s thought of everything so that he doesn''t have to get up iof it goes...  A very good shot! 9', '2004-01-14 04:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(541931, 54561, 12802, '<td valign="top">This could have been a better photograph if you had used a long exposure.  We could have seen some nice light trails from the car.  The shape of the road would have made it quite interesting.  5</td>', 'This could have been a better photograph if you had used a long exposure.  We could have seen some nice light trails from the car.  The shape of the road would have made it quite interesting.  5', '2004-01-14 04:24:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(541946, 54668, 15407, '<td valign="top">Although I have a problem with the depiticion of \"Cig''s\", this shot is technically excellent and meets the ''After Dark'' theme as well as if not better than any other in the challenge. Kudos!  As it turns out I rated your picture the highest in the challenge... Independent of the ''ciggie'' ~ it''s a winner.  I particularly like the way you worked the lighting &amp; exposure. When first viewed my eye is drawn to the bright spot in the picture whereupon the subtle , yet brilliant, glow of the cig is revealed.  That feature would be lost on any that only judge from thumbnails.  Features garnering my appreciation &amp; pondering include; the source of ''smoke'', as it''s wispy look does not suggest steam nor do I think the ciggie or model could have produced that much smoke with one puff.  Your light source(s) producing the glow on the neck, hat, chin &amp; what may be the left side collar. The right arm, wrist &amp; hand.  Even the gaze upon the Ciggie by the model is conveyed very well.   All of those features add up to a photo which is too good to be considered just a "lucky shot".  You clearly exhibit the much coveted trait of ''Photographers Eye''.  I rate this shot a "Ribbon Winner"<br/>Tim<br/></td>', 'Although I have a problem with the depiticion of \"Cig''s\", this shot is technically excellent and meets the ''After Dark'' theme as well as if not better than any other in the challenge. Kudos!  As it turns out I rated your picture the highest in the challenge... Independent of the ''ciggie'' ~ it''s a winner.  I particularly like the way you worked the lighting & exposure. When first viewed my eye is drawn to the bright spot in the picture whereupon the subtle , yet brilliant, glow of the cig is revealed.  That feature would be lost on any that only judge from thumbnails.  Features garnering my appreciation & pondering include; the source of ''smoke'', as it''s wispy look does not suggest steam nor do I think the ciggie or model could have produced that much smoke with one puff.  Your light source(s) producing the glow on the neck, hat, chin & what may be the left side collar. The right arm, wrist & hand.  Even the gaze upon the Ciggie by the model is conveyed very well.   All of those features add up to a photo which is too good to be considered just a "lucky shot".  You clearly exhibit the much coveted trait of ''Photographers Eye''.  I rate this shot a "Ribbon Winner"Tim', '2004-01-14 04:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(541949, 54712, 15407, '<td valign="top">Wonderful Picture... AH to have a place like that to go home to! ...Inspirational comes to mind.</td>', 'Wonderful Picture... AH to have a place like that to go home to! ...Inspirational comes to mind.', '2004-01-14 04:55:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(541960, 54534, 15407, '<td valign="top">Some of those memories don''t fade.... What a picture... It won''t soon fade from my memory either.</td>', 'Some of those memories don''t fade.... What a picture... It won''t soon fade from my memory either.', '2004-01-14 05:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(541987, 54727, 13474, '<td valign="top">OK.......</td>', 'OK.......', '2004-01-14 06:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(542340, 54575, 5822, '<td valign="top">Would have preferred a bit more cropping on top to eliminate some of the sky. Also, your waterfall appears blown out to the left.  Overall, the image is too busy for me.</td>', 'Would have preferred a bit more cropping on top to eliminate some of the sky. Also, your waterfall appears blown out to the left.  Overall, the image is too busy for me.', '2004-01-14 10:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(542350, 54627, 5822, '<td valign="top">Very nice low key shot. I love the reflection of the cobblestone street leading to the door and then your eye moves up to the starred light.  High contrast is excellent effect and overall leads to a moody feel.  The star effect I think is overdone and maybe one with fewer points would have been more effective for me. I guess this is jj</td>', 'Very nice low key shot. I love the reflection of the cobblestone street leading to the door and then your eye moves up to the starred light.  High contrast is excellent effect and overall leads to a moody feel.  The star effect I think is overdone and maybe one with fewer points would have been more effective for me. I guess this is jj', '2004-01-14 10:37:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(542365, 54398, 5822, '<td valign="top">I would guess this was done with a black light. I like the color, but think there is too much blue and would have preferred more of the black background showing as this adds more interesting contrast.</td>', 'I would guess this was done with a black light. I like the color, but think there is too much blue and would have preferred more of the black background showing as this adds more interesting contrast.', '2004-01-14 10:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(542441, 54514, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like the way you''ve focused in on the man in the white and darkened the foreground.  Very well composed image, although, I don''t lke what appears to be a yellow cast and the glare of the street lights.</td>', 'I like the way you''ve focused in on the man in the white and darkened the foreground.  Very well composed image, although, I don''t lke what appears to be a yellow cast and the glare of the street lights.', '2004-01-14 11:18:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(542515, 54343, 12733, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what they are, but they are colorful and bright. Nice composition, color and overall sharpness.</td>', 'I don''t know what they are, but they are colorful and bright. Nice composition, color and overall sharpness.', '2004-01-14 11:41:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(542522, 54534, 12733, '<td valign="top">The dim lighting on the person versus bright background gets your message across very effectively. The large out-of-focus structure at the right does pull the viewer''s eye away from the main subject, unfortunately.</td>', 'The dim lighting on the person versus bright background gets your message across very effectively. The large out-of-focus structure at the right does pull the viewer''s eye away from the main subject, unfortunately.', '2004-01-14 11:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(542523, 54527, 12733, '<td valign="top">Great choice of angle (could be an entry in point of view) and great colors.</td>', 'Great choice of angle (could be an entry in point of view) and great colors.', '2004-01-14 11:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(542529, 54773, 12733, '<td valign="top">Beautiful reflections and a nice silhouette to separate sky from water.</td>', 'Beautiful reflections and a nice silhouette to separate sky from water.', '2004-01-14 11:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(542537, 54621, 12733, '<td valign="top">This is a cute photo, but I''m not sure Gino''s truck rides are any better at night than in daylight. Still, a nice shot - well lighted and composed.</td>', 'This is a cute photo, but I''m not sure Gino''s truck rides are any better at night than in daylight. Still, a nice shot - well lighted and composed.', '2004-01-14 11:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(542541, 54324, 12733, '<td valign="top">The lights certainly say "after dark," but I think the shot would have worked better with less dark space between the various signs.</td>', 'The lights certainly say "after dark," but I think the shot would have worked better with less dark space between the various signs.', '2004-01-14 11:48:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(542546, 54703, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very sharp; kind of an old-fashioned effect from the days when everyone used 4x5 cameras and black and white film. Did you use a star burst filter to get he flare effects on the headlights?</td>', 'Very sharp; kind of an old-fashioned effect from the days when everyone used 4x5 cameras and black and white film. Did you use a star burst filter to get he flare effects on the headlights?', '2004-01-14 11:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(542563, 54565, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, and the excellent choice of shutter speed to make the train a "ghost," but I think the whole photo could be darker to emphasize the night aspect. Best would have been less exposure in the camera, but lacking that some work on the levels or curves could have cut the brightnesst.</td>', 'I like the idea, and the excellent choice of shutter speed to make the train a "ghost," but I think the whole photo could be darker to emphasize the night aspect. Best would have been less exposure in the camera, but lacking that some work on the levels or curves could have cut the brightnesst.', '2004-01-14 11:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(542565, 54201, 12733, '<td valign="top">The lighting really makes the subject; I imagine that in daylight this would be a fairly mundane industrial scene.</td>', 'The lighting really makes the subject; I imagine that in daylight this would be a fairly mundane industrial scene.', '2004-01-14 11:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(542567, 54736, 12733, '<td valign="top">The tree provides an interesting shape, and the picture is nicely composed, but the lighting looks very artificial and my first instinct is to say this tree would look better in daylight.</td>', 'The tree provides an interesting shape, and the picture is nicely composed, but the lighting looks very artificial and my first instinct is to say this tree would look better in daylight.', '2004-01-14 11:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(542574, 54725, 12733, '<td valign="top">An interesting take on the challenge, and the lighting is good. I like the nice, tight crop and the black background to give a sense of a night shot.</td>', 'An interesting take on the challenge, and the lighting is good. I like the nice, tight crop and the black background to give a sense of a night shot.', '2004-01-14 11:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(542577, 54276, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very nice contrast between the building''s light and the dark of night. Tood compromise on exposure to keep the surroundings dark while getting the glow of the building''s lights.</td>', 'Very nice contrast between the building''s light and the dark of night. Tood compromise on exposure to keep the surroundings dark while getting the glow of the building''s lights.', '2004-01-14 12:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(542579, 54727, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like the way you''ve isolated the sign and kept the exposure low enough to be sure the background stays black.</td>', 'I like the way you''ve isolated the sign and kept the exposure low enough to be sure the background stays black.', '2004-01-14 12:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(542589, 54464, 12733, '<td valign="top">Interesting lighting, and a nice shutter speed to get the sense of movement in the water.The subject itself is also interesting, and it raises the kinds of questions that keep me looking.  I think the water below the falls at the right is over exposed, and the flare just in front of the building is also distracting.</td>', 'Interesting lighting, and a nice shutter speed to get the sense of movement in the water.The subject itself is also interesting, and it raises the kinds of questions that keep me looking.  I think the water below the falls at the right is over exposed, and the flare just in front of the building is also distracting.', '2004-01-14 12:05:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(542592, 54759, 12733, '<td valign="top">The sky colors are beautiful, and the framing is really interesting. What is the top section of the frame?</td>', 'The sky colors are beautiful, and the framing is really interesting. What is the top section of the frame?', '2004-01-14 12:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(542597, 54477, 12733, '<td valign="top">This looks like a great panorama, but unfortunately the reproduction is so small it makes it hard to tell just how good it is.</td>', 'This looks like a great panorama, but unfortunately the reproduction is so small it makes it hard to tell just how good it is.', '2004-01-14 12:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(542602, 54688, 12733, '<td valign="top">This photo conveys a beautiful mood, calm yet slightly menacing. What is the light source behind those trees?</td>', 'This photo conveys a beautiful mood, calm yet slightly menacing. What is the light source behind those trees?', '2004-01-14 12:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(542609, 54775, 12733, '<td valign="top">The frost conveys an interesting pattern; the completely burned out moon is an unfortuate distraction. I don''t know if an exposure that gave the moon some detail would have ruined the effect of the frost, but some underexposure may have been worth a try.</td>', 'The frost conveys an interesting pattern; the completely burned out moon is an unfortuate distraction. I don''t know if an exposure that gave the moon some detail would have ruined the effect of the frost, but some underexposure may have been worth a try.', '2004-01-14 12:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(542613, 53919, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the color, but not the blown-out highlights.</td>', 'I like the composition and the color, but not the blown-out highlights.', '2004-01-14 12:11:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(542620, 54514, 12733, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting and intriguing shot. Is it a neighborhood market or "garage sale?" What does happen every Thursday night, and where is the neighborhood?</td>', 'This is an interesting and intriguing shot. Is it a neighborhood market or "garage sale?" What does happen every Thursday night, and where is the neighborhood?', '2004-01-14 12:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(542626, 54613, 12733, '<td valign="top">The exposure in this picture is a nice compromise between bringing out the glow of the lights and retaining the darkness of sky and buildings. Very nice.</td>', 'The exposure in this picture is a nice compromise between bringing out the glow of the lights and retaining the darkness of sky and buildings. Very nice.', '2004-01-14 12:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(542629, 54749, 12733, '<td valign="top">I really like the fluffy effect of the long exposrue on the water. The lighting is very dramatic.</td>', 'I really like the fluffy effect of the long exposrue on the water. The lighting is very dramatic.', '2004-01-14 12:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(542635, 54627, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very nice mood photo. I can imagine Jack the Ripper lurking around the next bend. Did you use a star burst filter to get the flare effect on the street light?</td>', 'Very nice mood photo. I can imagine Jack the Ripper lurking around the next bend. Did you use a star burst filter to get the flare effect on the street light?', '2004-01-14 12:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(542640, 54645, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very pretty. I like the reflections of the light on the water, and the effect of the ice on part of the pool. I think less exposure, or some darkening with levels in the post processing, would have made this a more dramatic night shot.</td>', 'Very pretty. I like the reflections of the light on the water, and the effect of the ice on part of the pool. I think less exposure, or some darkening with levels in the post processing, would have made this a more dramatic night shot.', '2004-01-14 12:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(542646, 54642, 12733, '<td valign="top">This is a very moody, mysterious picture. I like the greenish cast and the darkness outside the pools of light cast by the lamps.</td>', 'This is a very moody, mysterious picture. I like the greenish cast and the darkness outside the pools of light cast by the lamps.', '2004-01-14 12:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(542650, 54716, 12733, '<td valign="top">The streak effect is great. I would have liked to see a bit more exposure and/or more striaks.</td>', 'The streak effect is great. I would have liked to see a bit more exposure and/or more striaks.', '2004-01-14 12:21:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(542654, 54671, 12733, '<td valign="top">This must bring back memories for a lot of people who read by flashlight after bedtime. The lighting, expression and composition are great. Was there another light source besides the flashlight?</td>', 'This must bring back memories for a lot of people who read by flashlight after bedtime. The lighting, expression and composition are great. Was there another light source besides the flashlight?', '2004-01-14 12:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(542664, 54758, 12733, '<td valign="top">You caught an interesting phenomenon, and the overall composition is pleasing, but the focus is way too soft.</td>', 'You caught an interesting phenomenon, and the overall composition is pleasing, but the focus is way too soft.', '2004-01-14 12:24:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(542668, 54712, 12733, '<td valign="top">Pretty reflections, and a nice composition. Did you use a star burst filter to get the rays on the spotlight?</td>', 'Pretty reflections, and a nice composition. Did you use a star burst filter to get the rays on the spotlight?', '2004-01-14 12:25:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(542672, 54635, 12733, '<td valign="top">Spectacular shot. Great lighting, good catch. Do you cover accidents and fires in your work?</td>', 'Spectacular shot. Great lighting, good catch. Do you cover accidents and fires in your work?', '2004-01-14 12:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(542679, 54033, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice black and white shot. I like the contrast between the lighted houses and the dark water in the foreground, along with the muted reflections.</td>', 'Nice black and white shot. I like the contrast between the lighted houses and the dark water in the foreground, along with the muted reflections.', '2004-01-14 12:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(542686, 54598, 12733, '<td valign="top">You hit the right compromise between enough exposure to bring out the lights while keeping it low enough to preserve the dark background. Very nice.</td>', 'You hit the right compromise between enough exposure to bring out the lights while keeping it low enough to preserve the dark background. Very nice.', '2004-01-14 12:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(542694, 54665, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like the looming silhouettes, along with the dramatic sky.</td>', 'I like the looming silhouettes, along with the dramatic sky.', '2004-01-14 12:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(542696, 54730, 12733, '<td valign="top">The darkness helps to isolate the shape of the windmill; very nice.</td>', 'The darkness helps to isolate the shape of the windmill; very nice.', '2004-01-14 12:32:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(542698, 54766, 12733, '<td valign="top">An attractive model, nicely posed, lighted and photographed.</td>', 'An attractive model, nicely posed, lighted and photographed.', '2004-01-14 12:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(542701, 54774, 12733, '<td valign="top">They supplied the brilliant colors; you photographed them perfectly. I like the composition, with the main entrance off to the side, rather than in front where it might be too dominant.</td>', 'They supplied the brilliant colors; you photographed them perfectly. I like the composition, with the main entrance off to the side, rather than in front where it might be too dominant.', '2004-01-14 12:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(542704, 54672, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice to see humor in a photo, especially when the composition, lighting and sharpness are also really good.</td>', 'Nice to see humor in a photo, especially when the composition, lighting and sharpness are also really good.', '2004-01-14 12:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(542706, 54466, 12733, '<td valign="top">Placing the couple in a small section of the picture is very effective. Leaving in the background gives the picture an ambiance that a closer point of view would have lost. The way the lights and the lighter sidewalk lead toward the coulple adds to the effect of the composition.</td>', 'Placing the couple in a small section of the picture is very effective. Leaving in the background gives the picture an ambiance that a closer point of view would have lost. The way the lights and the lighter sidewalk lead toward the coulple adds to the effect of the composition.', '2004-01-14 12:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(542708, 54488, 12733, '<td valign="top">He does look like a creature that should hide during the day, but of course he doesn''t. Good choice to take the building at an angle - it increases the dramatic feel of the shot.</td>', 'He does look like a creature that should hide during the day, but of course he doesn''t. Good choice to take the building at an angle - it increases the dramatic feel of the shot.', '2004-01-14 12:39:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(542712, 54374, 7707, '<td valign="top">You got some blur on this shot.  Need a tripod or a more steady tripod.</td>', 'You got some blur on this shot.  Need a tripod or a more steady tripod.', '2004-01-14 12:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(542714, 54206, 12733, '<td valign="top">A bit less exposure would have added some detail to the moon. I don''t know if that would have preserved the interesting pattern of branches or not. If not, I would certainly go with your choice of a blank moon. If the exposure reduction were to add detail without spoiling the branches, I would go with it.</td>', 'A bit less exposure would have added some detail to the moon. I don''t know if that would have preserved the interesting pattern of branches or not. If not, I would certainly go with your choice of a blank moon. If the exposure reduction were to add detail without spoiling the branches, I would go with it.', '2004-01-14 12:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(542716, 54703, 7707, '<td valign="top">It looks like the crop could be rotated a little be counter clockwise.</td>', 'It looks like the crop could be rotated a little be counter clockwise.', '2004-01-14 12:43:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(542718, 54662, 12733, '<td valign="top">I think less exposure, or darkening in the post processing, would have made this a more dramatic shot. As it is, the low point of view and the scattering of lights does make the menacing mood of your title and an interesting composition.</td>', 'I think less exposure, or darkening in the post processing, would have made this a more dramatic shot. As it is, the low point of view and the scattering of lights does make the menacing mood of your title and an interesting composition.', '2004-01-14 12:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(542722, 54117, 12733, '<td valign="top">The sharp lines of the mosque and the pink coloring make this look more like a painting than a photograph. Very nice effect. The trees provide a nice contrast to those severe lines.</td>', 'The sharp lines of the mosque and the pink coloring make this look more like a painting than a photograph. Very nice effect. The trees provide a nice contrast to those severe lines.', '2004-01-14 12:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(542839, 54607, 5822, '<td valign="top">hahaha...This must be The Village in NYC or SF.  I like the way you''ve captured the lighting of the display. Certainly an original and very unique take on this challenge.</td>', 'hahaha...This must be The Village in NYC or SF.  I like the way you''ve captured the lighting of the display. Certainly an original and very unique take on this challenge.', '2004-01-14 13:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(542844, 54642, 5822, '<td valign="top">I can barely see the castle at the top of the mt, but still, you''ve captured a beautiful and breathtaking scene at night.</td>', 'I can barely see the castle at the top of the mt, but still, you''ve captured a beautiful and breathtaking scene at night.', '2004-01-14 13:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(542856, 54688, 5822, '<td valign="top"></td>', '', '2004-01-14 13:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(542881, 54223, 5822, '<td valign="top">Composition is a little too bottom heavy, busy and crowded. I also think the fountain is too hot and the sky could be darker, but I like the colors.</td>', 'Composition is a little too bottom heavy, busy and crowded. I also think the fountain is too hot and the sky could be darker, but I like the colors.', '2004-01-14 13:33:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(542889, 54464, 5822, '<td valign="top">You have two very large hot spots but I like the colors and the smooth texture of the  water.</td>', 'You have two very large hot spots but I like the colors and the smooth texture of the  water.', '2004-01-14 13:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(542892, 54639, 5822, '<td valign="top">Can''t tell what this is cause it''s way too dark.</td>', 'Can''t tell what this is cause it''s way too dark.', '2004-01-14 13:37:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(542897, 54594, 5822, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and touching. Well done.</td>', 'Beautiful and touching. Well done.', '2004-01-14 13:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(542905, 54467, 5822, '<td valign="top">Terrific! These matchsticks look like burning human figures standing back to back. Very creative and well done. I like it very much.</td>', 'Terrific! These matchsticks look like burning human figures standing back to back. Very creative and well done. I like it very much.', '2004-01-14 13:47:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(542909, 54380, 5822, '<td valign="top">Very impressive photo !  Though I find the lighting a bit strong on the bottom (guess you had to have it like that to cover your foot tracks?),  I find this to be a very compelling picture. The colors are great and I love what you did with the bottom border.  You really get the impression here of the bike sinking with the darker part of the photo weighing down heavily on it. Very well done. Bravo!</td>', 'Very impressive photo !  Though I find the lighting a bit strong on the bottom (guess you had to have it like that to cover your foot tracks?),  I find this to be a very compelling picture. The colors are great and I love what you did with the bottom border.  You really get the impression here of the bike sinking with the darker part of the photo weighing down heavily on it. Very well done. Bravo!', '2004-01-14 13:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(542935, 54766, 4090, '<td valign="top">stunning - great lighting and focus</td>', 'stunning - great lighting and focus', '2004-01-14 14:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(542977, 54614, 16135, '<td valign="top">tell me how you did this, it is awesome</td>', 'tell me how you did this, it is awesome', '2004-01-14 14:45:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(543045, 54758, 10858, '<td valign="top">I like the colourful reflections, though your photo should be really sharper. What happened to the border? I think it would be better if there would be border on all four sides or none at all.</td>', 'I like the colourful reflections, though your photo should be really sharper. What happened to the border? I think it would be better if there would be border on all four sides or none at all.', '2004-01-14 15:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(543061, 54466, 10858, '<td valign="top">I think the light source on the top should be cropped. Anyway, I like the story and the composition here. :-)</td>', 'I think the light source on the top should be cropped. Anyway, I like the story and the composition here. :-)', '2004-01-14 15:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
