(544172, 54477, 9906, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry but this is just way too small.  I would much rather see a small portion of this view where I can appreciate the detail.  I''m sure that this would be the bomb as a poster size print but...<br/>TC</td>', 'I''m sorry but this is just way too small.  I would much rather see a small portion of this view where I can appreciate the detail.  I''m sure that this would be the bomb as a poster size print but...TC', '2004-01-15 01:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(544174, 54758, 9906, '<td valign="top">There is no focal point in this shot either photographicly or compositionaly...<br/>TC</td>', 'There is no focal point in this shot either photographicly or compositionaly...TC', '2004-01-15 01:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(544176, 54728, 9906, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, this is a very nice shot, but the challenge said ''After Dark'' not ''Almost but not quite Dark''<br/>TC</td>', 'I''m sorry, this is a very nice shot, but the challenge said ''After Dark'' not ''Almost but not quite Dark''TC', '2004-01-15 01:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(544179, 54613, 1717, '<td valign="top">awesome pic...has a surreal look to it with the steam rising out of the buildings.  great work!</td>', 'awesome pic...has a surreal look to it with the steam rising out of the buildings.  great work!', '2004-01-15 01:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(544181, 54642, 9906, '<td valign="top">This is an awesome photo and an awesome example of when you can get away with having two different qualities of light.  The lamplight contrasting against the moonlight creates atmosphere.  Beautiful.  I can''t wait to see your settings on this, not that I can think of one spot in my personal existance space to use this...<br/>TC</td>', 'This is an awesome photo and an awesome example of when you can get away with having two different qualities of light.  The lamplight contrasting against the moonlight creates atmosphere.  Beautiful.  I can''t wait to see your settings on this, not that I can think of one spot in my personal existance space to use this...TC', '2004-01-15 01:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(544183, 54759, 9906, '<td valign="top">I believe the name of the challenge was ''After dark'' not ''Just before after dark happens''...<br/>TC</td>', 'I believe the name of the challenge was ''After dark'' not ''Just before after dark happens''...TC', '2004-01-15 01:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(544184, 54719, 1717, '<td valign="top">eeeeeeek!  nice pic, though ;)</td>', 'eeeeeeek!  nice pic, though ;)', '2004-01-15 01:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(544187, 54553, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture!  Good composition.  There is something a bit odd about the perspective though.  Can''t put my finger on it.  Wish I knew what camera you had...<br/>TC</td>', 'Very nice capture!  Good composition.  There is something a bit odd about the perspective though.  Can''t put my finger on it.  Wish I knew what camera you had...TC', '2004-01-15 01:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(544188, 54730, 1717, '<td valign="top">great low key image...i really like the composition.</td>', 'great low key image...i really like the composition.', '2004-01-15 01:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(544189, 54530, 9906, '<td valign="top">First observation, the spear man doesn''t have one...<br/>TC</td>', 'First observation, the spear man doesn''t have one...TC', '2004-01-15 01:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(544190, 53986, 1717, '<td valign="top">love the perspective...good work!</td>', 'love the perspective...good work!', '2004-01-15 01:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(544192, 54749, 9906, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, but would prefer to see more of far detail and less of near.<br/>TC</td>', 'Nice capture, but would prefer to see more of far detail and less of near.TC', '2004-01-15 01:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(544194, 54668, 1717, '<td valign="top">great silhouette and lighting.  i love the red glow of the cigarette...great work!</td>', 'great silhouette and lighting.  i love the red glow of the cigarette...great work!', '2004-01-15 01:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(544196, 54690, 9906, '<td valign="top">First observation:  This appears to be a simulator from the light coming in the windows.  Second observation:  This is too small.  I can''t see any detail.<br/>TC</td>', 'First observation:  This appears to be a simulator from the light coming in the windows.  Second observation:  This is too small.  I can''t see any detail.TC', '2004-01-15 01:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
