(544198, 54716, 9906, '<td valign="top">Two personal notes for a shot like this.  To REALLY work, you need a longer exposure so you don''t have so many starts and stops.  Also you need more detail other than motion lights to give more motion impact.<br/>TC</td>', 'Two personal notes for a shot like this.  To REALLY work, you need a longer exposure so you don''t have so many starts and stops.  Also you need more detail other than motion lights to give more motion impact.TC', '2004-01-15 01:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(544201, 54662, 9906, '<td valign="top">Not sure I like the angle you have the building at, but love the night time tonality, lines, cloud textures and little bit of extra detail to help give some size perspective!  What building is this?<br/>TC</td>', 'Not sure I like the angle you have the building at, but love the night time tonality, lines, cloud textures and little bit of extra detail to help give some size perspective!  What building is this?TC', '2004-01-15 02:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
