(544211, 54575, 9906, '<td valign="top">This does not appear to be quite in focus....  Were you on a tripod or hand held?  It gives me the impression of slight motion blur that kills the otherwise nice composition...<br/>TC</td>', 'This does not appear to be quite in focus....  Were you on a tripod or hand held?  It gives me the impression of slight motion blur that kills the otherwise nice composition...TC', '2004-01-15 02:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
