(544217, 54631, 9906, '<td valign="top">Lighting effect is just a touch too much on her face.  Her expression on the other hand is PRICELESS!  Hope she got an awesome bedtime snack after this!  Great composition.<br/>TC</td>', 'Lighting effect is just a touch too much on her face.  Her expression on the other hand is PRICELESS!  Hope she got an awesome bedtime snack after this!  Great composition.TC', '2004-01-15 02:12:32.000000', NULL, 1),
