(544318, 54621, 16075, '<td valign="top">Great colors against the dark background and very crisp and clean photography.</td>', 'Great colors against the dark background and very crisp and clean photography.', '2004-01-15 06:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(544319, 54711, 16075, '<td valign="top">Good sunset photo.</td>', 'Good sunset photo.', '2004-01-15 06:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(544395, 54624, 15854, '<td valign="top">Very nice</td>', 'Very nice', '2004-01-15 08:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(544448, 54662, 14603, '<td valign="top">Wish I could find this sort of building near me :-(<br/>It`s design must make it a very prized subject for photography.<br/>You have taken advantage of it`s assets very well indeed and the motion blur of the clouds works very well with the overall sharpness of the shot. I think that the other buildings (in the foreground and to the right) help the composition by adding a splash of contrasting colour. Excellent shot..well done....9</td>', 'Wish I could find this sort of building near me :-(It`s design must make it a very prized subject for photography.You have taken advantage of it`s assets very well indeed and the motion blur of the clouds works very well with the overall sharpness of the shot. I think that the other buildings (in the foreground and to the right) help the composition by adding a splash of contrasting colour. Excellent shot..well done....9', '2004-01-15 09:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(544718, 54645, 6008, '<td valign="top">What looks like water/ice and snow makes for an interesting foreground addition. Unfortunately the vehicles take away something, and with them being so distant and soft as well they really dont help much at all. The lights seem a little overexposed too. I like how the buildings seem to go up higher with each one, like stairs.</td>', 'What looks like water/ice and snow makes for an interesting foreground addition. Unfortunately the vehicles take away something, and with them being so distant and soft as well they really dont help much at all. The lights seem a little overexposed too. I like how the buildings seem to go up higher with each one, like stairs.', '2004-01-15 12:25:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(544720, 54261, 6008, '<td valign="top">Not going to get too far with less than half a tank of gas! The angle is interesting in an unconventional kinda way. It''s certainly bright and the water on the windscreen to blur and abstract whatever was beyond it is interesting too. Everything seems fairly sharp and exposed just fine. It''s a good technical shot, but doesnt really do much for me personally.</td>', 'Not going to get too far with less than half a tank of gas! The angle is interesting in an unconventional kinda way. It''s certainly bright and the water on the windscreen to blur and abstract whatever was beyond it is interesting too. Everything seems fairly sharp and exposed just fine. It''s a good technical shot, but doesnt really do much for me personally.', '2004-01-15 12:27:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(544724, 54688, 6008, '<td valign="top">This has a great atmosphere and mood to it. I''m tempted to feel that the light is a little too extreme/harsh to be ambient and so it doesnt feel as soft as I would have liked, but I like the gradient of dark to light. Composition is good, the trees seem nicely sharp, and the shadows falling across the path is a nice touch too. Very nicely shot.</td>', 'This has a great atmosphere and mood to it. I''m tempted to feel that the light is a little too extreme/harsh to be ambient and so it doesnt feel as soft as I would have liked, but I like the gradient of dark to light. Composition is good, the trees seem nicely sharp, and the shadows falling across the path is a nice touch too. Very nicely shot.', '2004-01-15 12:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(544729, 54727, 6008, '<td valign="top">Hrm, not had much experience with shooting or looking at neon sign photographs so not sure how to critique this. Personally, I dont get much of a reaction to this. The diagonal composition is good, it doesnt appear blurry although there are a few strands of light in a few places. I assume that was the thickness of the light and most neon is bright so not quite sure about the exposure either. It''s not a bad shot, it''s just kinda there. Sorry I couldnt have been more helpful.</td>', 'Hrm, not had much experience with shooting or looking at neon sign photographs so not sure how to critique this. Personally, I dont get much of a reaction to this. The diagonal composition is good, it doesnt appear blurry although there are a few strands of light in a few places. I assume that was the thickness of the light and most neon is bright so not quite sure about the exposure either. It''s not a bad shot, it''s just kinda there. Sorry I couldnt have been more helpful.', '2004-01-15 12:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(544731, 54560, 6008, '<td valign="top">Not sure what this is but it looks kinda odd. The placement of the item doesnt really compliment it well, and seems to unbalances the composition. The effects look very similar to funky editing filters, which I personally am not a fan of when seemingly used this way. I''m sure there are fans of funky abstract art, I''m just not one of them, sorry.</td>', 'Not sure what this is but it looks kinda odd. The placement of the item doesnt really compliment it well, and seems to unbalances the composition. The effects look very similar to funky editing filters, which I personally am not a fan of when seemingly used this way. I''m sure there are fans of funky abstract art, I''m just not one of them, sorry.', '2004-01-15 12:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(544858, 54668, 10686, '<td valign="top">The lighting here is very effective and I like the contrast between the blue of the backlit smoke and the orange of the burning cigarette. Also, you have maintained a good separation between the subject and the background. The way that the subject is holding the cigarette seems awkward, as though he''s getting ready to put the wrong end into his mouth (OUCH!)</td>', 'The lighting here is very effective and I like the contrast between the blue of the backlit smoke and the orange of the burning cigarette. Also, you have maintained a good separation between the subject and the background. The way that the subject is holding the cigarette seems awkward, as though he''s getting ready to put the wrong end into his mouth (OUCH!)', '2004-01-15 15:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(544861, 54719, 10686, '<td valign="top">weird and creepy, I like it</td>', 'weird and creepy, I like it', '2004-01-15 15:17:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(544878, 54530, 11895, '<td valign="top">interesting lighting</td>', 'interesting lighting', '2004-01-15 15:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(544883, 54527, 5534, '<td valign="top">Nice angle on the Eiffel Tower. Like the lighting also, can see this hanging on someone''s wall. Nice.</td>', 'Nice angle on the Eiffel Tower. Like the lighting also, can see this hanging on someone''s wall. Nice.', '2004-01-15 15:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(544887, 54467, 5534, '<td valign="top">Like how you can see the details of the matches in within the flame also, but with all the negative space the photo seems a bit boring. Maybe a tighter crop would help? Excellent shot overall. 8</td>', 'Like how you can see the details of the matches in within the flame also, but with all the negative space the photo seems a bit boring. Maybe a tighter crop would help? Excellent shot overall. 8', '2004-01-15 15:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(544900, 54773, 10686, '<td valign="top">pretty colors, I don''t care for the border and the leaves in the upper left and the twigs at the bottom are distracting, they aren''t prominent enough to serve as a real foreground elements that  provide a sense of depth.</td>', 'pretty colors, I don''t care for the border and the leaves in the upper left and the twigs at the bottom are distracting, they aren''t prominent enough to serve as a real foreground elements that  provide a sense of depth.', '2004-01-15 16:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(544961, 54542, 10047, '<td valign="top">Nice effect and excellent colors.</td>', 'Nice effect and excellent colors.', '2004-01-15 16:42:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(544962, 54712, 14620, '<td valign="top">I love this photo!  The relection on the lake is fantastic, the lighting is perfect and the colors are just right.  I love how the light reflects the green of the trees.  What a great place!</td>', 'I love this photo!  The relection on the lake is fantastic, the lighting is perfect and the colors are just right.  I love how the light reflects the green of the trees.  What a great place!', '2004-01-15 16:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(544967, 54565, 10047, '<td valign="top">Excellent effect. I''m not sure if you could do anything about the bright lights on the left. They distract a little.</td>', 'Excellent effect. I''m not sure if you could do anything about the bright lights on the left. They distract a little.', '2004-01-15 16:43:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(544969, 54178, 10047, '<td valign="top">Nice warm colors and composition.</td>', 'Nice warm colors and composition.', '2004-01-15 16:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(544970, 54727, 14620, '<td valign="top">In an effort to give more feedback, here goes.  The colors in this could definetly be more vibrant, being a neon sign and all.  And the crop is uninteresting.  Maybe if it had been off center or there was something else in the picture to add a little more interest.  The idea is good for an after dark shot though.</td>', 'In an effort to give more feedback, here goes.  The colors in this could definetly be more vibrant, being a neon sign and all.  And the crop is uninteresting.  Maybe if it had been off center or there was something else in the picture to add a little more interest.  The idea is good for an after dark shot though.', '2004-01-15 16:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(544973, 54768, 10047, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting effect. Maybe too centered, but still an interesting photo.</td>', 'Nice lighting effect. Maybe too centered, but still an interesting photo.', '2004-01-15 16:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(544976, 54668, 10047, '<td valign="top">Been there and done that. Excellent capture with the back lighting and profile.</td>', 'Been there and done that. Excellent capture with the back lighting and profile.', '2004-01-15 16:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(544978, 54743, 14620, '<td valign="top">This is hard being a night shot, but it''s a little too noisy.  Neatimage might have helped here.  I think with something like this I would have tried to make this a soft picture as opposed to the sharpness to maybe give more of a glow to the scene.  I like the idea of shooting the moon through the trees.</td>', 'This is hard being a night shot, but it''s a little too noisy.  Neatimage might have helped here.  I think with something like this I would have tried to make this a soft picture as opposed to the sharpness to maybe give more of a glow to the scene.  I like the idea of shooting the moon through the trees.', '2004-01-15 16:47:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(544980, 54717, 10047, '<td valign="top">Neat lighting effect. I like the gold tones.</td>', 'Neat lighting effect. I like the gold tones.', '2004-01-15 16:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(544981, 54374, 14620, '<td valign="top">This was just a little too busy and little too blurry for my taste.  The lighting really does help bring out the features of the tree.</td>', 'This was just a little too busy and little too blurry for my taste.  The lighting really does help bring out the features of the tree.', '2004-01-15 16:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(544983, 54488, 10047, '<td valign="top">Excellent angle, contrast, and composition. Should have entered this in the POV challenge also.</td>', 'Excellent angle, contrast, and composition. Should have entered this in the POV challenge also.', '2004-01-15 16:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(544984, 54117, 10047, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and composition.</td>', 'Nice colors and composition.', '2004-01-15 16:51:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(544986, 54466, 14620, '<td valign="top">This photo to me is too wide open.  I would have tried to bring it in a little closer to the subjects because as it stands now I think you lose the impact of your message by barely being able to see them.  Maybe even gone more verticle with it to include the top of the street lamp and less of a horizontal shot.</td>', 'This photo to me is too wide open.  I would have tried to bring it in a little closer to the subjects because as it stands now I think you lose the impact of your message by barely being able to see them.  Maybe even gone more verticle with it to include the top of the street lamp and less of a horizontal shot.', '2004-01-15 16:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(544988, 54534, 10047, '<td valign="top">Ghost recon? Nice transparent effect. The light in the upper right is a little distracting, but I like the composition and the concentration.</td>', 'Ghost recon? Nice transparent effect. The light in the upper right is a little distracting, but I like the composition and the concentration.', '2004-01-15 16:53:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(544989, 54374, 12131, '<td valign="top">I like the way the moon looks in the background, surrounded by trees, but the tree branches are a little too clear.  They seem to take away from the mystery of it.  Perhaps if there was more going on behind the initial branches.  I guess you might say that I''d like to see more of the night sky hidden.  Good shot overall, incredibly bright moon.</td>', 'I like the way the moon looks in the background, surrounded by trees, but the tree branches are a little too clear.  They seem to take away from the mystery of it.  Perhaps if there was more going on behind the initial branches.  I guess you might say that I''d like to see more of the night sky hidden.  Good shot overall, incredibly bright moon.', '2004-01-15 16:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(544992, 54553, 14620, '<td valign="top">This is so pretty!  Beautiful lighting and the picture is so crisp.  The only thing is it seems a little tilted or uneven or something.  Can''t quite put my finger on it.  I really like the light coming through the windows from the inside but the glare from the left window is a little distracting.  Overall though, a very nice picture.</td>', 'This is so pretty!  Beautiful lighting and the picture is so crisp.  The only thing is it seems a little tilted or uneven or something.  Can''t quite put my finger on it.  I really like the light coming through the windows from the inside but the glare from the left window is a little distracting.  Overall though, a very nice picture.', '2004-01-15 16:55:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(544995, 54477, 14620, '<td valign="top">Great cityscape, I just wish it were bigger.</td>', 'Great cityscape, I just wish it were bigger.', '2004-01-15 16:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(544996, 54488, 12131, '<td valign="top">I like the subject and the stone edifice against the black sky, but I think that the lighting in the forefront takes away from the ominous feel that the gargoyle and the stone seem to be representing.</td>', 'I like the subject and the stone edifice against the black sky, but I think that the lighting in the forefront takes away from the ominous feel that the gargoyle and the stone seem to be representing.', '2004-01-15 16:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(544999, 54688, 12131, '<td valign="top">Love the color.  It seems almost as though a miracle or a really bright fire is happening beyond the trees.  It makes me want to peek around the corner.</td>', 'Love the color.  It seems almost as though a miracle or a really bright fire is happening beyond the trees.  It makes me want to peek around the corner.', '2004-01-15 16:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(545000, 54627, 14620, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorite shots.  It so simple.  I love the effect of the lone light and the way it brings out the texture in the road.  I think this is a great "After Dark" shot.</td>', 'This is one of my favorite shots.  It so simple.  I love the effect of the lone light and the way it brings out the texture in the road.  I think this is a great "After Dark" shot.', '2004-01-15 16:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(545001, 54206, 12131, '<td valign="top">Okay, I hope you win.  I love this shot. The isolation around the moon with the presence of the bony-finger-like branches is awesome.  I think the one thing that would make this shot better is the lack of the second moon, but sometimes those things can''t be helped.  Gorgeous shot.</td>', 'Okay, I hope you win.  I love this shot. The isolation around the moon with the presence of the bony-finger-like branches is awesome.  I think the one thing that would make this shot better is the lack of the second moon, but sometimes those things can''t be helped.  Gorgeous shot.', '2004-01-15 17:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(545003, 54033, 14620, '<td valign="top">Something about this photo I find striking.  The composition is good, I like how you left much of the beach in the bottom of the picture.  It''s a little noisy, but I wouldnt'' mark it down for that, one because it is a night shot and two, because I think it kind of adds the atmosphere of the picture.  Nice Job!</td>', 'Something about this photo I find striking.  The composition is good, I like how you left much of the beach in the bottom of the picture.  It''s a little noisy, but I wouldnt'' mark it down for that, one because it is a night shot and two, because I think it kind of adds the atmosphere of the picture.  Nice Job!', '2004-01-15 17:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(545005, 54776, 14620, '<td valign="top">I really like the lightness of this picture.  For a night shot, it''s interesting cause the tree just seems to glow.  And the stars are a nice touch.</td>', 'I really like the lightness of this picture.  For a night shot, it''s interesting cause the tree just seems to glow.  And the stars are a nice touch.', '2004-01-15 17:02:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(545006, 54703, 14620, '<td valign="top">I love the grittyness of this picture.  The angle is awesome, the cityscape in the backround is great and the star effect of some of the headlights is a really nice  touch.  Very Cool!</td>', 'I love the grittyness of this picture.  The angle is awesome, the cityscape in the backround is great and the star effect of some of the headlights is a really nice  touch.  Very Cool!', '2004-01-15 17:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(545008, 54627, 12131, '<td valign="top">Jack the Ripper springs to mind.  If I may offer a suggestion, maybe lighten the shadow to a bit more on the gray scale, not enough to take away the mystery but enough to make the audience wonder if a shape is human or not.  Just a bit more spookiness.  I like this as it is though.</td>', 'Jack the Ripper springs to mind.  If I may offer a suggestion, maybe lighten the shadow to a bit more on the gray scale, not enough to take away the mystery but enough to make the audience wonder if a shape is human or not.  Just a bit more spookiness.  I like this as it is though.', '2004-01-15 17:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(545009, 53986, 14620, '<td valign="top">Beautiful subject!  The sky is amazing and the glow of the moon on the rocks is fantastic.  Very pretty.</td>', 'Beautiful subject!  The sky is amazing and the glow of the moon on the rocks is fantastic.  Very pretty.', '2004-01-15 17:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(545011, 54759, 12131, '<td valign="top">I like this. The overhang adds a great touch.  Where was this taken?</td>', 'I like this. The overhang adds a great touch.  Where was this taken?', '2004-01-15 17:07:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(545013, 54672, 12131, '<td valign="top">Very interesting structure, where was this taken?  It does look insanely like some interplanetary being just decided to land and make a bit of a splash.  Good interpretation.</td>', 'Very interesting structure, where was this taken?  It does look insanely like some interplanetary being just decided to land and make a bit of a splash.  Good interpretation.', '2004-01-15 17:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(545015, 54705, 14620, '<td valign="top">Fantastic!  This sky is brilliant from the clouds to the colors to the one lone star.  And the contrast of the foreground and the skiers and the tilt of the horizon is very nice.</td>', 'Fantastic!  This sky is brilliant from the clouds to the colors to the one lone star.  And the contrast of the foreground and the skiers and the tilt of the horizon is very nice.', '2004-01-15 17:11:06.000000', NULL, 1),
