(545021, 54642, 14620, '<td valign="top">Amazing, this is a great picture.  The colors in the sky and the glow of the snow are wonderful.  I might have chose to crop a little more on the right side just to get rid of the little twigs in the corner and the sign.  But other than that, I love this.</td>', 'Amazing, this is a great picture.  The colors in the sky and the glow of the snow are wonderful.  I might have chose to crop a little more on the right side just to get rid of the little twigs in the corner and the sign.  But other than that, I love this.', '2004-01-15 17:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
