(545046, 54614, 14620, '<td valign="top">This is a very interesting effect.  It took me a few times to see it and once I realized what it was it made it all that more creepy.  And I like the choice of a top hat too, not sure why.  Maybe it just adds to the creepiness of this.  Very original idea.  Sidenote: the graffiti on the tree is just a little bit distracting</td>', 'This is a very interesting effect.  It took me a few times to see it and once I realized what it was it made it all that more creepy.  And I like the choice of a top hat too, not sure why.  Maybe it just adds to the creepiness of this.  Very original idea.  Sidenote: the graffiti on the tree is just a little bit distracting', '2004-01-15 17:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
