(545063, 54576, 14620, '<td valign="top">This is almost a great moon shot.  It is a little blurry, but as someone who has been trying to get a good one also, I know how hard it can be (still haven''t done it).  The positioning is nice.  Not the same "middle of the photograph" composition.</td>', 'This is almost a great moon shot.  It is a little blurry, but as someone who has been trying to get a good one also, I know how hard it can be (still haven''t done it).  The positioning is nice.  Not the same "middle of the photograph" composition.', '2004-01-15 17:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(545067, 54764, 14620, '<td valign="top">Just a little blurry and if the birds were what you were going for, I think I would have tried to zoom in more on them  to make them more of a dominate feature than what they are here.  The sky is very nice.  You might also try to crop out the trees along the bottom as ther is not enough of them to be an important part but just enough to be a distraction.  Hope this helps.</td>', 'Just a little blurry and if the birds were what you were going for, I think I would have tried to zoom in more on them  to make them more of a dominate feature than what they are here.  The sky is very nice.  You might also try to crop out the trees along the bottom as ther is not enough of them to be an important part but just enough to be a distraction.  Hope this helps.', '2004-01-15 17:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
