(545115, 54770, 2158, '<td valign="top">I find this too dark.  One of the hints I''ve read in photography books is to take night photos while there is still some blue in the sky.  This might have helped here.<br/>I had a look at it in photoshop and some minor brightness and contrast adjustments can bring out quite a bit more detail too.</td>', 'I find this too dark.  One of the hints I''ve read in photography books is to take night photos while there is still some blue in the sky.  This might have helped here.I had a look at it in photoshop and some minor brightness and contrast adjustments can bring out quite a bit more detail too.', '2004-01-15 18:37:57.000000', NULL, 1),
