(546370, 54688, 7504, '<td valign="top">I like this very much.  The misty light is very moody and the large old trees are lovely.  Nice job!</td>', 'I like this very much.  The misty light is very moody and the large old trees are lovely.  Nice job!', '2004-01-16 23:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(546374, 54744, 7504, '<td valign="top">This is so lovely and serene.  It''s like "Stopping by the Woods on a Snowy Evening".</td>', 'This is so lovely and serene.  It''s like "Stopping by the Woods on a Snowy Evening".', '2004-01-16 23:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(546375, 54458, 16052, '<td valign="top">Blurred imagery in upper left distracting for me.  Very nicely done though.</td>', 'Blurred imagery in upper left distracting for me.  Very nicely done though.', '2004-01-16 23:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(546379, 54553, 16052, '<td valign="top">Appear very welcoming and warm.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Appear very welcoming and warm.  Nicely done.', '2004-01-16 23:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(546392, 54635, 16052, '<td valign="top">A bit busy in composition, but it does draw you in.</td>', 'A bit busy in composition, but it does draw you in.', '2004-01-16 23:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(546394, 54717, 16052, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done.</td>', 'Very nicely done.', '2004-01-16 23:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(546397, 54033, 16052, '<td valign="top">Great job on composition.</td>', 'Great job on composition.', '2004-01-16 23:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(546402, 54759, 7504, '<td valign="top">I love how this is framed.</td>', 'I love how this is framed.', '2004-01-16 23:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(546408, 54223, 7504, '<td valign="top">The fountain seems a bit over exposed.  I love the lighting on the tower though.</td>', 'The fountain seems a bit over exposed.  I love the lighting on the tower though.', '2004-01-16 23:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(546410, 54599, 7504, '<td valign="top">The stars are so beautiful in this photo.  I love the blue tones.</td>', 'The stars are so beautiful in this photo.  I love the blue tones.', '2004-01-16 23:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(546411, 54703, 16052, '<td valign="top">Foreground makes excellent use of contrast, but contrast appears a bit off in background.  Good pic.</td>', 'Foreground makes excellent use of contrast, but contrast appears a bit off in background.  Good pic.', '2004-01-16 23:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(546477, 54719, 16188, '<td valign="top">This is mesmerizing... makes me want to back up and look closer at the same time (I''m allergic to spiders though I love the way they move)... beautifully done.</td>', 'This is mesmerizing... makes me want to back up and look closer at the same time (I''m allergic to spiders though I love the way they move)... beautifully done.', '2004-01-17 01:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(546478, 54688, 16188, '<td valign="top">Evocative and gorgeous.</td>', 'Evocative and gorgeous.', '2004-01-17 02:00:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(546479, 54594, 16188, '<td valign="top">I don''t know how you did this but it works.</td>', 'I don''t know how you did this but it works.', '2004-01-17 02:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(546480, 54671, 16188, '<td valign="top">This is wonderfully done and it really works.</td>', 'This is wonderfully done and it really works.', '2004-01-17 02:01:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(546483, 54627, 16188, '<td valign="top">This is the essence of a dark street and a light ahead... I love the textures.</td>', 'This is the essence of a dark street and a light ahead... I love the textures.', '2004-01-17 02:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(546485, 54466, 16188, '<td valign="top">I love the mood of this and that the couple comes into view as in real life, as you look around.</td>', 'I love the mood of this and that the couple comes into view as in real life, as you look around.', '2004-01-17 02:09:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(546486, 54542, 16188, '<td valign="top">This is a classic, beautifully done.</td>', 'This is a classic, beautifully done.', '2004-01-17 02:10:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(546487, 54665, 16188, '<td valign="top">Lovely and rythmic, the colors set the blackness off.</td>', 'Lovely and rythmic, the colors set the blackness off.', '2004-01-17 02:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(546490, 54599, 16188, '<td valign="top">This is achingly beautiful.</td>', 'This is achingly beautiful.', '2004-01-17 02:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(546492, 54607, 16188, '<td valign="top">Skillfully done and I love the concept.</td>', 'Skillfully done and I love the concept.', '2004-01-17 02:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(546493, 54775, 16188, '<td valign="top">I feel the frost when I look at this.</td>', 'I feel the frost when I look at this.', '2004-01-17 02:12:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(546494, 53986, 16188, '<td valign="top">Another truly gorgeous shot.  The colors and textures are palpable.</td>', 'Another truly gorgeous shot.  The colors and textures are palpable.', '2004-01-17 02:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(546495, 54716, 16188, '<td valign="top">I like the rythm of this.</td>', 'I like the rythm of this.', '2004-01-17 02:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(546496, 54206, 16188, '<td valign="top">I love that this is like a pupil, the double moon, and the branches framing it all.</td>', 'I love that this is like a pupil, the double moon, and the branches framing it all.', '2004-01-17 02:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(546497, 54703, 16188, '<td valign="top">Really wonderful use of black and white.  The shapes and perspective are nice, too.</td>', 'Really wonderful use of black and white.  The shapes and perspective are nice, too.', '2004-01-17 02:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(546498, 54728, 16188, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2004-01-17 02:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(546499, 54730, 16188, '<td valign="top">I love the angle of view, the shapes and meaning, and that it''s just ambient light.</td>', 'I love the angle of view, the shapes and meaning, and that it''s just ambient light.', '2004-01-17 02:16:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(546500, 54178, 16188, '<td valign="top">The colors and shapes really resonate for me.</td>', 'The colors and shapes really resonate for me.', '2004-01-17 02:17:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(546501, 54467, 16188, '<td valign="top">This is fantastic - beautifully done.</td>', 'This is fantastic - beautifully done.', '2004-01-17 02:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(546502, 54672, 16188, '<td valign="top">I think this definitely fits the bill of being something that''s more interesting because it''s taken in the dark.</td>', 'I think this definitely fits the bill of being something that''s more interesting because it''s taken in the dark.', '2004-01-17 02:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(546503, 54488, 16188, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot.</td>', 'This is a great shot.', '2004-01-17 02:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(546504, 54608, 16188, '<td valign="top">I like this, especially the placement.</td>', 'I like this, especially the placement.', '2004-01-17 02:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(546505, 54711, 16188, '<td valign="top">This is strangely evocative of embryonic life while at the same time scarily like what would happen if there were a meltdown.</td>', 'This is strangely evocative of embryonic life while at the same time scarily like what would happen if there were a meltdown.', '2004-01-17 02:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(546506, 54553, 16188, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and the symmetry is great.</td>', 'Beautiful and the symmetry is great.', '2004-01-17 02:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(546507, 54631, 16188, '<td valign="top">This is a clever image and works well.</td>', 'This is a clever image and works well.', '2004-01-17 02:23:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(546508, 54764, 16188, '<td valign="top">Very evocative - it took me three viewings before I really saw the birds.  I think it''s because of the overall pattern of the clouds.</td>', 'Very evocative - it took me three viewings before I really saw the birds.  I think it''s because of the overall pattern of the clouds.', '2004-01-17 02:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(546509, 54668, 16188, '<td valign="top">This is a great image but makes me wheeze a little (I have asthma). :)</td>', 'This is a great image but makes me wheeze a little (I have asthma). :)', '2004-01-17 02:25:36.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(546510, 54705, 16188, '<td valign="top">The scale and the color are fantastic.</td>', 'The scale and the color are fantastic.', '2004-01-17 02:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(546511, 54343, 16188, '<td valign="top">This is gorgeous but I have to admit that the title undercut the image for me.</td>', 'This is gorgeous but I have to admit that the title undercut the image for me.', '2004-01-17 02:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(546512, 54766, 16188, '<td valign="top">Beautifully framed and well shot, well posed.</td>', 'Beautifully framed and well shot, well posed.', '2004-01-17 02:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(546513, 54593, 16188, '<td valign="top">Gorgeously shot - perfectly framed.</td>', 'Gorgeously shot - perfectly framed.', '2004-01-17 02:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(546514, 54635, 16188, '<td valign="top">Really nice colors, shapes, rythms.</td>', 'Really nice colors, shapes, rythms.', '2004-01-17 02:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(546515, 54744, 16188, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of when I lived in places where there was snow... the silence that comes with it and I can almost taste snowflakes on my tongue.</td>', 'This reminds me of when I lived in places where there was snow... the silence that comes with it and I can almost taste snowflakes on my tongue.', '2004-01-17 02:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(546516, 54749, 16188, '<td valign="top">This is really interesting.</td>', 'This is really interesting.', '2004-01-17 02:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(546517, 54276, 16188, '<td valign="top">The blue light is great with the shapes and perspective.</td>', 'The blue light is great with the shapes and perspective.', '2004-01-17 02:30:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(546519, 54613, 16188, '<td valign="top">This is gorgeous.</td>', 'This is gorgeous.', '2004-01-17 02:31:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(546520, 54598, 16188, '<td valign="top">The colors really make this work.</td>', 'The colors really make this work.', '2004-01-17 02:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(546521, 54743, 16188, '<td valign="top">I like the way the moon looks like it\''s caught in the branches and can\''t get out.</td>', 'I like the way the moon looks like it\''s caught in the branches and can\''t get out.', '2004-01-17 02:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(546522, 54721, 16188, '<td valign="top">The perspective and the colors make this work.</td>', 'The perspective and the colors make this work.', '2004-01-17 02:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(546523, 54773, 16188, '<td valign="top">The colors seep into my eyes and mind while the shapes'' symmetry and rythm are very calming.</td>', 'The colors seep into my eyes and mind while the shapes'' symmetry and rythm are very calming.', '2004-01-17 02:36:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(546618, 54313, 3540, '<td valign="top">This is just a little bit soft.   I think I''m missing the point of the composition.</td>', 'This is just a little bit soft.   I think I''m missing the point of the composition.', '2004-01-17 08:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(546619, 54759, 3540, '<td valign="top">Nicely framed sunset.  The monochromatic sky is something I usually don''t like, but I think its kinda neat when its sandwiched between these 2 rock forms 8</td>', 'Nicely framed sunset.  The monochromatic sky is something I usually don''t like, but I think its kinda neat when its sandwiched between these 2 rock forms 8', '2004-01-17 08:12:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(546620, 53919, 3540, '<td valign="top">This subject in no way conveys to me anything about dark.  It seems lit too much to really imply anything about darkness either.  The texture of the petals is pretty good, but overall I don''t think this relates to the challenge as well as it should.</td>', 'This subject in no way conveys to me anything about dark.  It seems lit too much to really imply anything about darkness either.  The texture of the petals is pretty good, but overall I don''t think this relates to the challenge as well as it should.', '2004-01-17 08:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(546621, 54523, 3540, '<td valign="top">Star filters are always fun.  I''ve used them in several challenge shots.  I think in this shot they are meant to be the focal point, and they just dominate the image.  I''d rather see them as an accent instead of the subject.  I think the stars need to be greatly diminished so that you could expose this picture more without the stars overpowering the image even more.</td>', 'Star filters are always fun.  I''ve used them in several challenge shots.  I think in this shot they are meant to be the focal point, and they just dominate the image.  I''d rather see them as an accent instead of the subject.  I think the stars need to be greatly diminished so that you could expose this picture more without the stars overpowering the image even more.', '2004-01-17 08:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(546622, 54542, 3540, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous.  For the record, it just isn''t fair that I can''t live somwhere where I can take this kind of shot.  This is great.   I think top 10 - 9</td>', 'Gorgeous.  For the record, it just isn''t fair that I can''t live somwhere where I can take this kind of shot.  This is great.   I think top 10 - 9', '2004-01-17 08:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(546624, 54594, 3540, '<td valign="top">Nice work with this one.   The mom looks like she''s blurry a bit around the head but the rest of her looks pretty good.  Excellent idea and pretty well done.  I love long exposure shots myself. 8</td>', 'Nice work with this one.   The mom looks like she''s blurry a bit around the head but the rest of her looks pretty good.  Excellent idea and pretty well done.  I love long exposure shots myself. 8', '2004-01-17 08:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(546625, 54223, 2780, '<td valign="top">Really nice photo, the long exposure creates a nice look on the fountain.</td>', 'Really nice photo, the long exposure creates a nice look on the fountain.', '2004-01-17 08:25:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(546626, 54766, 2780, '<td valign="top">Not the typical approach to the challenge, but a good one none the less. Great lighting and pose.</td>', 'Not the typical approach to the challenge, but a good one none the less. Great lighting and pose.', '2004-01-17 08:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(546627, 54117, 3540, '<td valign="top">This looks like a lot of noise and banding in the sky on this one.   That or the sky is suffering from some overprocessing.  Colors are interesting in the sky.  I think this might be a little overexposed for my tastes tho.</td>', 'This looks like a lot of noise and banding in the sky on this one.   That or the sky is suffering from some overprocessing.  Colors are interesting in the sky.  I think this might be a little overexposed for my tastes tho.', '2004-01-17 08:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(546628, 54711, 2780, '<td valign="top">This seems a bit uneven. Rotating clockwise a little would level it up. The sun makes a really nice effect on the smoke, nicely captured.</td>', 'This seems a bit uneven. Rotating clockwise a little would level it up. The sun makes a really nice effect on the smoke, nicely captured.', '2004-01-17 08:27:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(546629, 54736, 2780, '<td valign="top">I like the use of negative space, very effective.</td>', 'I like the use of negative space, very effective.', '2004-01-17 08:27:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(546630, 54657, 3540, '<td valign="top">In my opinion, this photo needs to go somewhere.  It looks like a great backdrop but the subject or subjects went to the bathroom while you got the camera out.</td>', 'In my opinion, this photo needs to go somewhere.  It looks like a great backdrop but the subject or subjects went to the bathroom while you got the camera out.', '2004-01-17 08:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(546631, 54743, 2780, '<td valign="top">Seems very grainy and also the moon is overexposed. By using a shorter shutter time you could get detail in the moon and also reduce the noise. Also, try neatimage (www.neatimage.com) to remove noise.</td>', 'Seems very grainy and also the moon is overexposed. By using a shorter shutter time you could get detail in the moon and also reduce the noise. Also, try neatimage (www.neatimage.com) to remove noise.', '2004-01-17 08:28:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(546632, 54477, 2780, '<td valign="top">This is a bit small. I would have like to seen this take full advantage of the 640px limit. Also, the blacks seem washed out and grey. Try adjusting the brightness/contrast.</td>', 'This is a bit small. I would have like to seen this take full advantage of the 640px limit. Also, the blacks seem washed out and grey. Try adjusting the brightness/contrast.', '2004-01-17 08:29:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(546633, 54560, 2780, '<td valign="top">This is really weird, I have no idea what it is, and so I don''t know if it meets the challenge. What is it?</td>', 'This is really weird, I have no idea what it is, and so I don''t know if it meets the challenge. What is it?', '2004-01-17 08:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(546634, 54730, 2780, '<td valign="top">Nice silhouette. By increasing the contrast in Adobe® Photoshop® you could add a lot more drama into those clounds.</td>', 'Nice silhouette. By increasing the contrast in Adobe® Photoshop® you could add a lot more drama into those clounds.', '2004-01-17 08:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(546635, 54576, 2780, '<td valign="top">Nice negative space, but the moon isnt sharp enough.</td>', 'Nice negative space, but the moon isnt sharp enough.', '2004-01-17 08:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(546637, 54773, 2780, '<td valign="top">Very nice sunset colours with good silhouettes. The reflections make this shot extra good.</td>', 'Very nice sunset colours with good silhouettes. The reflections make this shot extra good.', '2004-01-17 08:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(546639, 54712, 2780, '<td valign="top">Nice reflection and good dramatic lighting. Could do with being a little sharper I think.</td>', 'Nice reflection and good dramatic lighting. Could do with being a little sharper I think.', '2004-01-17 08:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(546641, 54635, 2780, '<td valign="top">Amazing shot! I don\''t know what else to say other than 11. Oh, I can only give it 10? That\''ll have to do then. I''ll move down my other 10s to 9 just so that this photo can get the points it deserves.</td>', 'Amazing shot! I don\''t know what else to say other than 11. Oh, I can only give it 10? That\''ll have to do then. I''ll move down my other 10s to 9 just so that this photo can get the points it deserves.', '2004-01-17 08:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(546642, 54615, 2780, '<td valign="top">This is great, and very unusual. 9</td>', 'This is great, and very unusual. 9', '2004-01-17 08:35:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(546643, 54672, 2780, '<td valign="top">This is great! I love the lens flare, and the effect of the water. 9</td>', 'This is great! I love the lens flare, and the effect of the water. 9', '2004-01-17 08:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(546644, 54705, 3540, '<td valign="top">great concept and I love the diagonal horizon.  The skiers look like they need to be just a little closer and the skier on the left would be more better if he were in a more skiing like position.  The idea is awesome though.  7</td>', 'great concept and I love the diagonal horizon.  The skiers look like they need to be just a little closer and the skier on the left would be more better if he were in a more skiing like position.  The idea is awesome though.  7', '2004-01-17 08:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(546645, 54712, 3540, '<td valign="top">Looks like some of the focus was lost due to some movement, or wide aperture and the bottom is not in the focal plane.  Seems like probably the latter though since the top is very sharp.</td>', 'Looks like some of the focus was lost due to some movement, or wide aperture and the bottom is not in the focal plane.  Seems like probably the latter though since the top is very sharp.', '2004-01-17 08:36:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(546647, 54775, 2780, '<td valign="top">The frost creates a really nice abstract image. 8</td>', 'The frost creates a really nice abstract image. 8', '2004-01-17 08:39:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(546648, 54631, 3540, '<td valign="top">This is a really cute picture and I like the idea.  The girl is not quite as focused as she good be, but its close enough for me.   The one thing that would improve this shot a lot is the lighting.  I like the lighting on her face, but its quite bright on the pillow behind her.  If you could just concentrate the light on her face and darken the area around her, I think this would be a very successful picture.  Great book for the shot too and her expression is very very convincing.  good shot 7</td>', 'This is a really cute picture and I like the idea.  The girl is not quite as focused as she good be, but its close enough for me.   The one thing that would improve this shot a lot is the lighting.  I like the lighting on her face, but its quite bright on the pillow behind her.  If you could just concentrate the light on her face and darken the area around her, I think this would be a very successful picture.  Great book for the shot too and her expression is very very convincing.  good shot 7', '2004-01-17 08:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(546649, 54338, 2780, '<td valign="top">Creepy eyes :)</td>', 'Creepy eyes :)', '2004-01-17 08:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(546650, 54721, 2780, '<td valign="top">Seems a tad on the soft side to me</td>', 'Seems a tad on the soft side to me', '2004-01-17 08:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(546651, 54672, 3540, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo.  I like the shapes, hate the lens flare though.  nice job with the fountain too.</td>', 'Interesting photo.  I like the shapes, hate the lens flare though.  nice job with the fountain too.', '2004-01-17 08:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(546652, 54523, 2780, '<td valign="top">Great Shot. 9</td>', 'Great Shot. 9', '2004-01-17 08:40:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(546654, 54705, 2780, '<td valign="top">This shot is great. 9</td>', 'This shot is great. 9', '2004-01-17 08:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(546655, 54770, 3540, '<td valign="top">These ships are usually quite lit up at night.  This is a little strange to see this one dark.  I think that throws up a flag for me, but I''m not saying its wrong or anything.</td>', 'These ships are usually quite lit up at night.  This is a little strange to see this one dark.  I think that throws up a flag for me, but I''m not saying its wrong or anything.', '2004-01-17 08:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(546656, 54276, 2780, '<td valign="top">Really good choice with the blue tones</td>', 'Really good choice with the blue tones', '2004-01-17 08:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(546658, 53986, 2780, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition</td>', 'Very nice composition', '2004-01-17 08:44:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(546659, 54688, 3540, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of this picture but I don''t like how the light is pointed.  Whether you could help it or not, it seems to me that the light would''ve been better pointed up just a little more,  maybe giving us a little more trees and a little less sidewalk.</td>', 'I like the idea of this picture but I don''t like how the light is pointed.  Whether you could help it or not, it seems to me that the light would''ve been better pointed up just a little more,  maybe giving us a little more trees and a little less sidewalk.', '2004-01-17 08:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(546661, 54688, 2780, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot, one of my faves</td>', 'I really like this shot, one of my faves', '2004-01-17 08:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(546662, 54458, 3540, '<td valign="top">This is almost it.  I think its just a little bit hot, but I wouldn''t be surprised to see this in the top ten.  Nice work</td>', 'This is almost it.  I think its just a little bit hot, but I wouldn''t be surprised to see this in the top ten.  Nice work', '2004-01-17 08:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(546663, 54527, 3540, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!  I think showing just a little more of the tower would''ve been more to my liking.  It is fairly recognizable with this much showing.  With just a little more, I think it would''ve been unmistakable.  There are a couple spots that are pretty hot that may not be quite as noticeable if it were back just a bit further.</td>', 'Nice shot!  I think showing just a little more of the tower would''ve been more to my liking.  It is fairly recognizable with this much showing.  With just a little more, I think it would''ve been unmistakable.  There are a couple spots that are pretty hot that may not be quite as noticeable if it were back just a bit further.', '2004-01-17 08:48:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(546666, 54744, 3540, '<td valign="top">very nice.  The toning on this conveys the weather conditions nicely.  It looks like a cold picture.  I think this is really well done and my feeling is that it''ll probably be in the top 20, it should be in the top ten.  I really think this is well done 9</td>', 'very nice.  The toning on this conveys the weather conditions nicely.  It looks like a cold picture.  I think this is really well done and my feeling is that it''ll probably be in the top 20, it should be in the top ten.  I really think this is well done 9', '2004-01-17 08:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(546667, 54668, 3540, '<td valign="top">the position of the hand and the cigarette are the only thing I don''t like about this photo.  Its very unnatural.   Aside from that though, nice idea, great lighting and perfect exposure.  Good work 8</td>', 'the position of the hand and the cigarette are the only thing I don''t like about this photo.  Its very unnatural.   Aside from that though, nice idea, great lighting and perfect exposure.  Good work 8', '2004-01-17 08:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(546668, 54464, 3540, '<td valign="top">THe building as a backdrop for this seems so wrong.  It just doesn''t seem like it should be there.  The falls look okay.  There are a couple wicked hotspots though that are very distracting to the image.</td>', 'THe building as a backdrop for this seems so wrong.  It just doesn''t seem like it should be there.  The falls look okay.  There are a couple wicked hotspots though that are very distracting to the image.', '2004-01-17 08:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(546669, 54725, 3540, '<td valign="top">The idea here is generally good.  Get rid of the crap on the table in the foreground and tone the light down a bunch and you''d be in the ballpark.</td>', 'The idea here is generally good.  Get rid of the crap on the table in the foreground and tone the light down a bunch and you''d be in the ballpark.', '2004-01-17 08:56:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(546670, 54380, 3540, '<td valign="top">This is interesting lighting.  At first I really didn''t like it, but I think its tolerable now that I take a minute to look at it.  Its effective in keeping the background out of play.  The foreground lighting does make some of the engine chrome a litle hot though.</td>', 'This is interesting lighting.  At first I really didn''t like it, but I think its tolerable now that I take a minute to look at it.  Its effective in keeping the background out of play.  The foreground lighting does make some of the engine chrome a litle hot though.', '2004-01-17 08:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(546671, 54642, 3540, '<td valign="top">The texture of the rockface is great.  The exposure is a little bit longer than I''d like to see it.  The sky is banded or noisy or something.  The castle is diffiuclt to define though.</td>', 'The texture of the rockface is great.  The exposure is a little bit longer than I''d like to see it.  The sky is banded or noisy or something.  The castle is diffiuclt to define though.', '2004-01-17 08:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(546672, 54766, 3540, '<td valign="top">This looks like a boudoir portrait.  Its a pretty good one too.  I think it just needs a little bit of the details honed to make it really a hot photo.  Maybe just a little more light too.  I would think some nail polish and lipstick and maybe a little bit of a hairlight would really make this an awesome shot.</td>', 'This looks like a boudoir portrait.  Its a pretty good one too.  I think it just needs a little bit of the details honed to make it really a hot photo.  Maybe just a little more light too.  I would think some nail polish and lipstick and maybe a little bit of a hairlight would really make this an awesome shot.', '2004-01-17 09:02:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(546673, 54514, 3540, '<td valign="top">Lens flares are just overpowering to this shot.  I think trying to minimize those would help a lot.  I''m not sure this wouldn''t look great greyscaled too.  There isn''t a lot of color to lose</td>', 'Lens flares are just overpowering to this shot.  I think trying to minimize those would help a lot.  I''m not sure this wouldn''t look great greyscaled too.  There isn''t a lot of color to lose', '2004-01-17 09:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(546675, 54717, 3540, '<td valign="top">THe sky makes this shot, all the way.  Interesting lighting on the bulidings or whatever kind of structures they are.  This might be just a half stop or a stop under, which would leave it just a little brighter than what I''d like to see.  but definitely a good shot. 8</td>', 'THe sky makes this shot, all the way.  Interesting lighting on the bulidings or whatever kind of structures they are.  This might be just a half stop or a stop under, which would leave it just a little brighter than what I''d like to see.  but definitely a good shot. 8', '2004-01-17 09:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(546676, 54662, 3540, '<td valign="top">Cut some of the stuff off the bottom and I think this is a much more successful image.  I would''ve just left the tower and nothing else.  Great contrast between the tower and the sky.  The sky makes the image and you did right by making the title describe the sky.9</td>', 'Cut some of the stuff off the bottom and I think this is a much more successful image.  I would''ve just left the tower and nothing else.  Great contrast between the tower and the sky.  The sky makes the image and you did right by making the title describe the sky.9', '2004-01-17 09:09:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(546678, 54743, 3540, '<td valign="top">The sky is doing some nasty things to you in this photo.  There seems to be a ton of noise happening in it were it looks quite unnatural.</td>', 'The sky is doing some nasty things to you in this photo.  There seems to be a ton of noise happening in it were it looks quite unnatural.', '2004-01-17 09:12:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(546679, 54736, 3540, '<td valign="top">This photo has a lot of depth.  I don''t think the negative space in this photo is working to enhance the subject.  I think if you''d have cropped some of that off, you could''ve gotten we viewers closer to the subject and even added more depth to the photo.</td>', 'This photo has a lot of depth.  I don''t think the negative space in this photo is working to enhance the subject.  I think if you''d have cropped some of that off, you could''ve gotten we viewers closer to the subject and even added more depth to the photo.', '2004-01-17 09:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(546682, 54613, 3540, '<td valign="top">I would''ve made the tower more central as more of a focal point in the composition.  Good exposure and the smoke looks cool.  Just needs a better focal point, especiially since it is so busy.</td>', 'I would''ve made the tower more central as more of a focal point in the composition.  Good exposure and the smoke looks cool.  Just needs a better focal point, especiially since it is so busy.', '2004-01-17 09:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
