(546686, 54599, 3540, '<td valign="top">awesome color and exposure.  Its good but doesn''t have that little extra something to bring it over the top.  very very well taken photo.</td>', 'awesome color and exposure.  Its good but doesn''t have that little extra something to bring it over the top.  very very well taken photo.', '2004-01-17 09:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
