(547001, 54374, 8860, '<td valign="top">This is just too soft really. It''s a nice idea but the yellow hue on the branches quite ''pollutes'' the image. Perhaps mono would have been better and a steadier surface or less wind?<br/> <br/>I think finding somewhere which had no streetlights would have allowed the moon to light the branches and create more mood.</td>', 'This is just too soft really. It''s a nice idea but the yellow hue on the branches quite ''pollutes'' the image. Perhaps mono would have been better and a steadier surface or less wind? I think finding somewhere which had no streetlights would have allowed the moon to light the branches and create more mood.', '2004-01-17 18:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(547027, 54607, 2158, '<td valign="top">I wish you''d chosen a better lit dummy as the front one.</td>', 'I wish you''d chosen a better lit dummy as the front one.', '2004-01-17 19:23:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(547028, 54774, 2158, '<td valign="top">Personally I''d have moved a bit to the left so that the name of the place showed.</td>', 'Personally I''d have moved a bit to the left so that the name of the place showed.', '2004-01-17 19:25:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(547041, 54627, 14476, '<td valign="top">I looked at this again and again, bumping up the score each time.  Can''t go any higher.  10.  Beautiful.</td>', 'I looked at this again and again, bumping up the score each time.  Can''t go any higher.  10.  Beautiful.', '2004-01-17 19:35:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(547044, 54671, 14476, '<td valign="top">This is an exciting and technically excellent image.  10</td>', 'This is an exciting and technically excellent image.  10', '2004-01-17 19:36:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(547121, 54598, 9581, '<td valign="top">thats interesting!</td>', 'thats interesting!', '2004-01-17 21:35:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(547122, 54614, 9581, '<td valign="top">woah! Very uuuummmm I''m lost for words!</td>', 'woah! Very uuuummmm I''m lost for words!', '2004-01-17 21:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(547123, 54631, 9581, '<td valign="top">shes cute, looks scared too! Great picture!</td>', 'shes cute, looks scared too! Great picture!', '2004-01-17 21:40:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(547130, 54542, 15383, '<td valign="top">perfect exposure..</td>', 'perfect exposure..', '2004-01-17 21:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(547132, 54749, 9581, '<td valign="top">I think its been 24 years ago, I was only 5 years old, I remember standing there in that area thinking wow long ways down!  WOW Great picture!  I also remember watchin the big boat how close it get to the edge before fighting the current and going back! My parents were to afraid to ride it so we only watched!</td>', 'I think its been 24 years ago, I was only 5 years old, I remember standing there in that area thinking wow long ways down!  WOW Great picture!  I also remember watchin the big boat how close it get to the edge before fighting the current and going back! My parents were to afraid to ride it so we only watched!', '2004-01-17 21:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(547136, 54117, 14012, '<td valign="top">I like the colors. Seems to have a bit of noise, something like NeatImage would clean that up for you.</td>', 'I like the colors. Seems to have a bit of noise, something like NeatImage would clean that up for you.', '2004-01-17 22:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(547138, 54527, 14012, '<td valign="top">I like the angle. It looks like you overexposed just a bit.</td>', 'I like the angle. It looks like you overexposed just a bit.', '2004-01-17 22:08:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(547139, 54627, 14012, '<td valign="top">the high contrast B&amp;W works very good here</td>', 'the high contrast B&W works very good here', '2004-01-17 22:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(547140, 54542, 14012, '<td valign="top">exposure is about perfect here. I like the colors of the sky, the blue with the nice glow of the city lights. 9</td>', 'exposure is about perfect here. I like the colors of the sky, the blue with the nice glow of the city lights. 9', '2004-01-17 22:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(547141, 54338, 14012, '<td valign="top">not a bad shot, but there is really no orginality here, IMHO. It''s picture of a cat, in the dark. Go out and experiment and try new things.</td>', 'not a bad shot, but there is really no orginality here, IMHO. It''s picture of a cat, in the dark. Go out and experiment and try new things.', '2004-01-17 22:14:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(547142, 54719, 14012, '<td valign="top">might be better if the whole spider was in focus, instead of just it''s front legs</td>', 'might be better if the whole spider was in focus, instead of just it''s front legs', '2004-01-17 22:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(547148, 54725, 14012, '<td valign="top">lighting is a bit harsh, as the tops of the arm, phone, &amp; book pages are blown out. It''s a nice candid, but nothing really jumps out at me to make me want to rate it high.</td>', 'lighting is a bit harsh, as the tops of the arm, phone, & book pages are blown out. It''s a nice candid, but nothing really jumps out at me to make me want to rate it high.', '2004-01-17 22:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
