(547836, 54642, 12160, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, color, exposure. I love the perspective in this shot. I noticed the two branches sticking out from the right frame, it''s not very distracting as the eyes are quickly drawn to height of the subject, but I think I''d prefer cropping it out. 7 - bumping up to 8</td>', 'Nice composition, color, exposure. I love the perspective in this shot. I noticed the two branches sticking out from the right frame, it''s not very distracting as the eyes are quickly drawn to height of the subject, but I think I''d prefer cropping it out. 7 - bumping up to 8', '2004-01-18 18:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
