(547841, 53919, 12160, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo. I like the color, composition and the texture. Very sharp and I like the coolish tint the light gives off. For "after darlk" theme, for me personally a photo like this would be a stretch since this could be taken any time of the day in a studio setup. 8 - bumped up to 9</td>', 'Very nice photo. I like the color, composition and the texture. Very sharp and I like the coolish tint the light gives off. For "after darlk" theme, for me personally a photo like this would be a stretch since this could be taken any time of the day in a studio setup. 8 - bumped up to 9', '2004-01-18 18:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
