(549158, 54514, 12962, '<td valign="top">A more creative title (that describes buying 2nd hand shoes) should have erased the confusion as to what these people are doing.  I think many people missed the fact that the whole subject is buying 2nd hand shoes every Thursday night ... not just the shoes, or the light, or the umbrella or the people - as the act of buying used shoes is very foreign to a lot of Western rich people.</td>', 'A more creative title (that describes buying 2nd hand shoes) should have erased the confusion as to what these people are doing.  I think many people missed the fact that the whole subject is buying 2nd hand shoes every Thursday night ... not just the shoes, or the light, or the umbrella or the people - as the act of buying used shoes is very foreign to a lot of Western rich people.', '2004-01-19 14:47:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(549170, 54744, 14453, '<td valign="top">Bravo!!! Beau travail!</td>', 'Bravo!!! Beau travail!', '2004-01-19 14:58:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(549195, 54458, 3102, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the kind words!  I kinda thought the smoke was an interesting addition, but I see the reaction to it was mixed.  I actually had a few shots when the smoke wasn''t coming out of there, but there were other elements of those shots I didn''t like.  I''m really going to start petitioning for ribbons to be handed out for 4th place :)</td>', 'Thanks for all the kind words!  I kinda thought the smoke was an interesting addition, but I see the reaction to it was mixed.  I actually had a few shots when the smoke wasn''t coming out of there, but there were other elements of those shots I didn''t like.  I''m really going to start petitioning for ribbons to be handed out for 4th place :)', '2004-01-19 15:28:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(549344, 54534, 14001, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all of your comments.  I thought this image would do better, but after reading the comments I think I didn''t do a good enough job telling the story.  <br/> <br/>The lights to right are automobiles on the freeway.  Notice the white lights coming,and the red lights going.  The idea is that as war memories (or nightmares) fade, a new reality appears that can be just as frightening and disconcerting as the immediate life and death situations that one faces in war-time.</td>', 'Thanks for all of your comments.  I thought this image would do better, but after reading the comments I think I didn''t do a good enough job telling the story.   The lights to right are automobiles on the freeway.  Notice the white lights coming,and the red lights going.  The idea is that as war memories (or nightmares) fade, a new reality appears that can be just as frightening and disconcerting as the immediate life and death situations that one faces in war-time.', '2004-01-19 17:42:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(549360, 54719, 15751, '<td valign="top">i really expected this shot to do better in the contest.  I think its really creepy, especially because the depth of field makes the spider seems to be crawling out of the unknown or darkness, beyond the viewers comfort zone, and coming in to pounce!  Very emotional and very well done photograph.  Sorry you didnt do better.  Also think that this fits well with the challenge theme, since spiders are something scary that one normally associates with night/darkness.</td>', 'i really expected this shot to do better in the contest.  I think its really creepy, especially because the depth of field makes the spider seems to be crawling out of the unknown or darkness, beyond the viewers comfort zone, and coming in to pounce!  Very emotional and very well done photograph.  Sorry you didnt do better.  Also think that this fits well with the challenge theme, since spiders are something scary that one normally associates with night/darkness.', '2004-01-19 17:57:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(549365, 54716, 15751, '<td valign="top">i like the effect of only a few cars passing.  It conveys a feeling of loneliness that I think fits very well with your title.  This makes me think of all those lonely people driving home to their efficiency condos after a long day of mundane work in their cubicle.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-01-19 18:02:31.</i></td>', 'i like the effect of only a few cars passing.  It conveys a feeling of loneliness that I think fits very well with your title.  This makes me think of all those lonely people driving home to their efficiency condos after a long day of mundane work in their cubicle.', '2004-01-19 18:02:02.000000', '2004-01-19 18:02:31.000000', 0),
